{"type":"message","id":"98631bc0","parentId":"844dfaba","timestamp":"2026-03-29T11:05:12.918Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"已更新 heartbeat-state.json。\n\n现在给出汇报。","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"**OpenClaw 项目晚间简报**（2026-03-29）\n\n**待重点追踪：**\n- 🔴 **#56127**：WhatsApp 插件未配置也加载导致崩溃（P0 regression，影响所有用户）\n- 🔴 **#56124**：Telegram mention-gated 群组语音转录失效\n- 🔴 **#56143**：Discord ACP thread-bound sessions 完成时 threadId 丢失\n- 🔴 **#56173**：严重安全漏洞（/pair approve 绕过 admin scope guard，GHSA 已提交）\n\n**今日进展（10:30-19:03）：**\n- ⏸️ 等待 maintainer 回复（已支持 16+ 个 PR，0 个人为回复）\n\n**下一步：**\n明天早上继续社区扫描，保持推进节奏。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":61476,"output":194,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":61670,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774782290296,"responseId":"021774782291531bcecadb1a82be71fa1749367c2cf7e87ade37f"}}
