**root cause**：Webchat 消息被路由到活跃的 subagent 而不是 main session\n\n**可修性**：M\n\n---\n\n#### **#57306** - sessions_spawn model 参数失效\n**root cause**：model 参数触发生模型切换错误而不是设置初始模型\n\n**可修性**：M\n\n---\n\n#### **#57291** - Discord reconnect crash\n**root cause**：maxAttempts=0 导致 \"Max reconnect attempts (0) reached after code 1005\"\n\n**可修性**：S\n\n---\n\n#### **#56960** - openai-codex refresh_token_reused loop\n**root cause**：refresh_token_reused 错误导致每 30-90 秒重试\n\n**可修性**：M\n\n---\n\n请评估每个问题的可修性，按优先级处理。详情在 `memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md`。"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":80,"output":741,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":59841,"totalTokens":60662,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774828062089,"responseId":"0618ed1e82011defb248d35ff8c1e9a3"}}
