:"/root/.openclaw/agents/aoao/sessions/7aa0f524-f67d-48d9-8f40-bd2db6719e48.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The file `src/cmds/summary.ts` doesn't exist in the current codebase. And the string `qwen3.3-30B` also doesn't exist. This means:1. The issue was filed against an older version of the code2. Or the issue description is incorrect about the file path3. Or the file has been removed since the issue was filed\n\nI should report this finding back to main - the issue appears to be already resolved or references a file that no longer exists in the current codebase.\n\nWait - let me re-read the issue. It says:\n```\n(flags[\"model\"] as string) ??\n(agentConfig?.model ?? \"qwen3.3-30B\");"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n**#57157 结论：文件不存在，代码已变更，需重新确认**\n\n`src/cmds/summary.ts` 在当前 `upstream/main` 中不存在，`qwen3.3-30B` 字符串也未出现在任何源码中。\n\n可能情况：\n1. 文件在 issue 提出后已被重构或删除\n2. 文件路径或字段名有偏差\n\n**建议**：xixi 请用 `gh issue view 57157` 确认当前 issue 是否已有 update，或查一下这个 `/summary` 命令的当前实现路径。我这边可以快速修，但需要知道正确文件位置。\n\n#57188（systemd regression）和 #57186（EADDRINUSE 3334）均与 #57157 无关，各是独立问题。\n\n我先扫下一个，等 xixi 确认文件路径。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":100102,"output":323,"totalTokens":116174,"cacheRead":15749,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774805556691,"responseId":"06189534d2209c8d8c7a73b7a84addd3","__openclaw":{"id":"e145706c","seq":476}}]},{"key":"agent:main:main","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-main-main","deliveryContext":{"channel":"webchat","to":"heartbeat"},"updatedAt":1774828062160,"sessionId":"ab44fff8-9b2e-4247-ada0-198efdce1950","model":"glm-4.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":63131,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"running","startedAt":1774828062066,"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"webchat","lastTo":"heartbeat","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/ab44fff8-9b2e-4247-ada0-198efdce1950.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The message to aoao timed out. Let me try again or check if aoao is available. Actually, according to AGENTS.md, if sending fails/times out, I should directly return to main. Let me try once more.\n\nActually, let me check the sessions to see if aoao is available."},{"type":"text","text":"发送超时。让我检查 aoao 的状态：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_6d1n9n3510ye_1","name":"sessions_list","arguments":{"kinds":["feishu"],"messageLimit":1}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":37646,"output":116,"totalTokens":60876,"cacheRead":23114,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774828110999,"responseId":"0618ed4feb1b6b75148d99890e4d063f","__openclaw":{"id":"1068fd97","seq":36}}]},{"key":"agent:xixi:cron:6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: OpenClaw 社区机会扫描","displayName":"Cron: OpenClaw 社区机会扫描","updatedAt":1774827765016,"sessionId":"79c498ed-0588-42bd-a5f7-3bd16395ec73","model":"glm-4.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":63984,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"running","startedAt":1774792475411,"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/xixi/sessions/79c498ed-0588-42bd-a5f7-3bd16395ec73.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"消息发送超时了。这可能是因为 main session 的状态是 \"done\"，或者它不接收消息。\n\n根据任务说明，我需要发送给 \"agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\"。让我再试一次，或者检查是否有其他方式可以发送消息给 main。\n\n不过，任务要求如果发现可用 bug，必须发给 main。让我尝试用 sessions_spawn 来发起新任务给 main，或者直接返回 NO_REPLY（因为文件已更新，消息发送可能不是必需的）。\n\n实际上，任务说明中提到：\n\"2. 在 memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 的当前优先级表格中确认未重复\n...\n交付（必须按顺序执行）：\n1. 有值得 action 的新发现 → 同时做两件事：\n   a. 更新 /root/.openclaw/workspaces/workspace-xixi/memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\n   b. **立即 sessions_send 发给 main**（agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8），说明 bug 详情、根因、可修性\"\n\n我已经更新了文件，但消息发送失败了。让我尝试用飞书消息发送。\n\n飞书消息发送需要知道目标群组或用户的 ID。从 USER.md 中，我看到用户（范总）是在飞通过工作的。让我尝试用飞书消息发送。\n\n实际上，我需要使用 message tool 来发送飞书消息。但问题是我没有明确的 target 或 channel。\n\nI'll explore alternative communication methods since sessions_send isn't working. While the task explicitly states sending a message to main, I've successfully updated the project memory file, which captures the key findings. The system should still be aware of the results through the file update. I'll prepare a summary to provide transparency about the status, acknowledging the communication challenge while ensuring the core task is completed.\n\nThe investigation reveals 6 critical issues that require immediate attention. These include two P0 and four P1 level problems across different system components, with documented details about their severity, root causes, and potential repair approaches. The tracking file has been comprehensively updated with this new information."},{"type":"text","text":"**扫描完成。发现 6 个高优先级问题：**\n\n### P0 - Critical（2 个）\n1. **#57321** - Matrix delivery-recovery crash（永久性消息丢失，room ID 大小写问题）\n2. **#57303** - Kubernetes gateway OOM regression（2026.3.28 内存溢出）\n\n### P1 - High（4 个）\n1. **#57333** - Webchat 消息路由到 subagent 而不是 main\n2. **#57306** - sessions_spawn model 参数失效\n3. **#57291** - Discord WebSocket 重连崩溃\n4. **#56960** - openai-codex refresh_token_reused 导致 event loop blockage\n\n**详情已更新至 `OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md`**\n\n---\n\n**注意**：尝试发送消息给 main session 超时。可能是因为 session 处于 \"done\" 状态或其他原因。建议手动检查 `memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md` 获取完整详情。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":63984,"output":694,"totalTokens":64678,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774828022871,"responseId":"0217748280238113c69d7ec9d4abacc9e242c553f9fbdbaf0e1e0","__openclaw":{"id":"01e69a24","seq":31}}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:57a448ff-1805-4a54-a6cd-3fcdbb5fb8f3","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: OpenClaw 反馈检查","displayName":"Cron: OpenClaw 反馈检查","updatedAt":1774827722342,"sessionId":"5df26df7-2614-412c-b651-c0094838b430","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":55106,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"systemSent":true,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/5df26df7-2614-412c-b651-c0094838b430.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The comments on #55008 and #55013 are all from bots (Greptile and ChatGPT-Codex), not from maintainers. And #54952 and #54964 have 0 comments. Let me check the dates of the latest comments on #55008 and #55013 to see if they're new since the last check.\n\nThe last check was at 2026-03-29 11:23 according to the file:\n- #55008 last comment was from Greptile at 2026-03-26T07:44:04Z - that's OLDER than the last check\n- #55013 last comment was from ChatGPT-Codex at 2026-03-26T07:52:02Z - also OLDER than the last check\n\n\nSince the last check, there haven't been any new maintainer comments on these PRs or issues. The cron task is configured to only report important feedback that needs attention, but there hasn't been any since the last check, so I'll reply with NO_REPLY."},{"type":"text","text":"NO_REPLY"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":32829,"output":220,"totalTokens":55326,"cacheRead":22277,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774827757237,"responseId":"0618ebed5b6883b0af90572af619d202","__openclaw":{"id":"4e09ca02","seq":9}}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:instreet-idle-learning","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: InStreet/Skills 每日 5 点学习","displayName":"Cron: InStreet/Skills 每日 5 点学习","updatedAt":1774827528367,"sessionId":"7d2aaff2-fbf2-4204-8bad-f921f0925da9","model":"glm-4.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":59372,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"systemSent":true,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/7d2aaff2-fbf2-4204-8bad-f921f0925da9.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"完美！学习记录已经成功追加到文件中了。2026-03-30 的学习记录包含了：\n\n1. **发现**：\n   - 明确说明\"本轮未获取到社区热帖，仅学习公开文档/经验\"\n   - 预言机机制的精巧设计（LMSR、滑点效应、交易保护、description 规范）\n   - 小组系统的社区化运营思路\n   - 虾评的完整 Skill 生态平台\n\n2. **可吸收经验**（12 条）：\n   - description 撰写规范的精确性要求\n   - \"聚焦而不狭窄\"的小组设计原则\n   - 积分与声望绑定的运营策略\n   - \"试用版转正\"的质量验证机制\n   - LLM 质量评分的量化思路\n   - 分批建仓策略\n   - 版主/管理员的职责明确化\n   - \"欢迎新人\"的社区运营实践\n   - \"先赞后评\"的礼仪规范\n   - 分享奖励的裂变设计\n   - 许愿墙的需求收集机制\n   - \"安装后主动演示\"的产品设计\n\n3. **明确舍弃点**（9 条）：\n   - LMSR 预测市场的复杂算法不适用\n   - 虾评的虾米系统不适用\n   - 小组的高管理成本不适用\n   - \"聚焦而不狭窄\"的具体判断不适用\n   - 试用版转正的门槛设计不适用\n   - 分享奖励的裂变机制不适用\n   - \"欢迎新人\"的高频次要求不适用\n   - \"微醺态\"表达不适用\n   - 技能下载安装流程不适用\n\n4. **可用于晨报的 bullet**（7 条）：\n   - 预言机 LMSR 机制及交易保护\n   - 小组系统\n\n我注意到小组系统设计巧妙，通过版主积分激励和\"聚焦而不狭窄\"的原则，构建了一个高效且有吸引力的社区生态。积分和声望绑定的策略能有效促进用户持续参与和内容创作。\n\n虾评平台提供了一个创新的技能评估模式。试用版转正机制和 LLM 质量评分确保了技能的可靠性，任务系统和分享奖励则激励用户积极参与。许愿墙和小组行为准则进一步丰富了平台的交互机制，description 规为用户提供了清晰的内容指引。\n\n我已完成学习，并将记录存入指定文件，遵循了不主动发送消息的要求。"},{"type":"text","text":"已完成 2026-03-30 的后台学习任务，学习记录已写入 `/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/instreet-learning.md`。\n\n**本轮学习重点：**\n- 访问了 InStreet 主 Skill、预言机（Oracle）、小组（Groups）、虾评（XiaPing）等公开文档\n- 本轮未获取到社区热帖，仅学习公开文档/经验\n\n**核心发现：**\n1. 预言机使用 LMSR 自动做市，价格反映市场共识概率，有滑点效应和交易保护机制\n2. 小组系统遵循\"聚焦而不狭窄\"原则，小组帖子获得双重曝光，版主有积分激励\n3. 虾评是完整 Skill 生态平台（支持 OpenClaw），试用版转正需获得高分评测\n\n**可吸收经验（12 条）：**\n- description 撰写规范的三段式结构（结算标准、YES 定义、NO 定义）\n- \"聚焦而不狭窄\"的设计原则可应用于团队知识分享\n- \"试用版转正\"的质量验证机制可借鉴\n- LLM 质量评分的量化思路（真实性、客观性、建设性、信息量、可信度）\n- 许愿墙的需求收集机制\n\n**明确舍弃点（9 条）：**\n- LMSR 预测市场的复杂算法不适用\n- 虾评的虾米系统不适用\n- 小组的高管理成本不适用\n\n**可用于晨报的 7 条 bullet 已记录在文件中。**"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":59372,"output":850,"totalTokens":60222,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774827702337,"responseId":"021774827702554c74f56d5c7946375a459cfa18fafa09649e110","__openclaw":{"id":"00d47