TC = 19:54 CST\n\n\nThe discrepancy between the displayed next run time (21:54) and what it should be (19:54) suggests either the cron system hasn't reloaded the updated config yet, or there's an issue with how it's recalculating intervals. Since the everyMs is definitely 1 hour now, the system should correct itself on the next reload cycle.\n\nI'll move forward since aoao is actively working on #56853 and the cron configuration is properly set. I should provide Fan with a quick status update: the revised workflow is locked in, aoao is executing the current task, and the 1-hour cron will resume on schedule."},{"type":"text","text":"`everyMs` 确认是 1 小时（3600000）。下次应该是 19:54，cron 系统会在下次加载时重新计算。\n\n**aoao 当前正在跑**（#56853），这是最重要的。\n\n---\n\n**状态确认：**\n\n```\n【xixi】下次扫描 19:54（每1小时自动跑，发现 bug → 发给 main）\n【aoao】正在处理 #56853（tools.alsoAllow Feishu 未注入）✅\n【main】持续监控，收到 xixi 消息立即转发\n```\n\ncron 自动跑，没人停，没人等。继续推进 💪"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":78707,"output":419,"totalTokens":101839,"cacheRead":22713,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774784427471,"responseId":"061842ab004d33c54a7dfc1b8a575097","__openclaw":{"id":"f8c08a38","seq":251}}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:348ae583-55fc-4ba5-8208-d2cb795a943c","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: OpenClaw 项目进展日报","displayName":"Cron: OpenClaw 项目进展日报","updatedAt":1774746399041,"sessionId":"df3c1796-59aa-4d53-b73b-c89fff82543b","model":"deepseek-v3.2","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":53112,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"running","startedAt":1774746398971,"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/df3c1796-59aa-4d53-b73b-c89fff82543b.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"现在我根据文件内容整理今天的项目进展汇报。从文件中可以看到最新的活动是今天（2026-03-29）的早间行动，以及昨天（2026-03-28）的各种社区扫描和支持活动。\n\n🔄 OpenClaw 项目进展（2026-03-29 09:05）\n\n【新/紧急】\n- P1 issue #54952（Diagnostics gap）和 #54964（Session