{"type":"message","id":"34f64f0b","parentId":"0dee0e31","timestamp":"2026-03-29T23:49:01.356Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK, so from the sessions list I can see:\n\n1. aoao's status shows as \"done\" with last activity at 1774828080923 (2026-03-30T07:48:00Z approximately), meaning aoao was last active at about 7:48 AM Beijing time today\n2. The message to aoao timed out earlier\n\nBut from xixi's message at 07:46 GMT+8 today, xixi is reporting 6 new high-priority issues found between 21:42-23:42 UTC yesterday (2026-03-29). The xixi cron session is still \"running\".\n\nSince the message to aoao timed out, I need to try again. According to AGENTS.md:\n- If sending fails/times out, directly return to main\n- main receives xixi's message and should forward to aoao\n\nI should try sending to aoao again. But wait - I'm currently in the main session, and I received this message from xixi. According to AGENTS.md, I should:\n1. Read xixi's message (done)\n2. Forward to aoao (attempted but timed out)\n3. Update memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\n4. Do nothing else, don't wait for confirmation\n\nSince aoao is \"done\", maybe I should spawn a new subagent to handle these issues instead?\n\nActually, let me try sending to aoao one more time directly. If it still times out, I should note this and continue.\n\nActually, looking at the session status more carefully:\n- aoao's last activity was at 1774828080923 which is about 2026-03-30T07:48:00Z = 2026-03-30T15:48:00 Beijing time... wait no. Let me recalculate.\n\n1774828080923 ms / 1000 = 1774828080.923 seconds\nfromtimestamp(1774828080) ≈ 2026-03-30 07:48:00 UTC = 2026-03-30 15:48:00 Beijing time\n\nBut that's from the session update time, not necessarily when aoao was last active. The session status shows \"endedAt\": 1774681761731 which is earlier.\n\nLet me just try sending to aoao again with a shorter timeout, or try a different approach.\n\nActually, I should try sending the message again. Let me use sessions_send with a timeout parameter.","thinkingSignature":"6f5d60a08461a9286134b2c80a29af29defd67ff75179c7073b5a032371e9fcc"},{"type":"text","text":"aoao session 的状态是 \"done\"，消息发送超时了。让我重试一次转发给 aoao：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_cgpkls9fprew_1","name":"sessions_send","arguments":{"sessionKey":"agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506","message":"aoao，立即处理这 6 个新发现的高优先级问题（来自 xixi 扫描，2026-03-29 21:42-23:42 UTC）：\n\n### P0 - Critical（2 个）\n\n**#57321** - Matrix delivery-recovery crash（永久性消息丢失）\n- root cause：Session keys normalize room IDs to lowercase，delivery-recovery 使用小写 ID 重试导致 403，sync loop crash\n- 可修性：M\n\n**#57303** - Kubernetes gateway OOM regression\n- root cause：2026.3.28 在 Kubernetes 部署中 Node/V8 heap OOM\n- 可修性：M\n\n### P1 - High（4 个）\n\n**#57333** - Webchat 消息路由错误（路由到 subagent 而不是 main）\n**#57306** - sessions_spawn model 参数失效\n**#57291** - Discord reconnect crash（maxAttempts=0）\n**#56960** - openai-codex refresh_token_reused loop（event loop blockage）\n\n详情在 memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md。","timeoutSeconds":30}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":70986,"output":851,"cacheRead":23114,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":94951,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774828118736,"responseId":"0618ed56a12bf46b633bd55fcaf9aa93"}}
