{"type":"message","id":"dedfd7d8","parentId":"ccdd32a8","timestamp":"2026-03-29T23:49:46.595Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still timing out. aoao session is done and not responding. According to AGENTS.md, if sending fails/times out, I should directly return to main. But wait - I'm already main. The issue is that aoao is not available.\n\nLooking at the sessions list, aoao's status is \"done\" and ended at 1774681761731. The current time is about 1774828500 (2026-03-30T07:41:40 UTC = 2026-03-30T15:41:40 Beijing time). So aoao ended at around 2026-03-30T03:02:41 Beijing time - about 12.5 hours ago.\n\nAccording to AGENTS.md:\n- \"失败 / 超时 / 无权限 / 不确定，一律直接回 main\"\n\nSo I should report this situation to the user (main is me, but I'm acting as a subagent here). Wait, no - I AM main in this context. The message from xixi came to me (main).\n\nSo what should I do when aoao is unavailable?\n1. According to AGENTS.md: \"失败 / 超时 / 无权限 / 不确定，一律直接回 main\" - but I'm main\n2. The AGENTS.md also says I should update memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\n\nLet me:\n1. Update the OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md with these 6 new issues\n2. Report to the user that aoao is unavailable and these issues need attention\n\nActually, looking at the message more carefully - this is coming from xixi's cron scan. xixi is saying there are 6 new high-priority issues. I need to:\n1. Forward to aoao - but aoao is timing out\n\n\n2. Update OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md with these findings\n3. Inform the user about aoao's unavailability while flagging these 6 critical issues that require immediate attention\n\nSince aoao keeps timing out, I'll proceed with updating the project documentation and alerting the user to the new issues that need prioritization.","thinkingSignature":"3c63ae2db6794ed2e2b97eb95730d67b79af3f258463f563ec0acff320e4a7f1"},{"type":"text","text":"\naoao 持续超时（session 状态为 done，已结束约 12 小时前）。根据 AGENTS.md 规则，继续执行：\n\n1. 更新 memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\n2. 报告给用户\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_wt4sxknv3e77_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","offset":1,"limit":50}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":71934,"output":534,"cacheRead":23114,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":95582,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774828171550,"responseId":"0618ed8cb8e0f0d1a8a84f9bcd3aa649"}}
{"type":"message","id":"6474664e","parentId":"dedfd7d8","timestamp":"2026-03-29T23:49:46.648Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_wt4sxknv3e77_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# OpenClaw 贡献项目 — 状态追踪\n\n> 本文件为范总在这个群的单一事实来源。\n> 所有 OpenClaw 项目的进展、决策、阻塞统一记录此处。\n> main agent 在此群只更新和引用此文件。\n\n---\n\n## 🔄 明日（2026-03-27）启动检查清单\n\n如果你在 2026-03-27 读到这个文件，按以下顺序检查：\n\n1. **读本文件的「当前优先级」表格** — 了解所有 open 项状态\n2. **读 cron 反馈记录**（`memory/openclaw-feedback-check.txt`）— 检查是否有新 feedback\n3. **执行 cron 反馈检查** — `openclaw cron run` 触发反馈检查，看是否有新回复\n4. **如有新反馈**：按优先级处理（issue 评论 → review 回复 → 决定下一步）\n5. **如无新反馈**：继续扫描新 PR/issue，xixi 调研 → main review 循环\n6. **向范总汇报**：在群 oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3 发送简短早间状态\n\n---\n\n## 项目背景\n\n**目标**：帮助范总冲进 OpenClaw contributors 前 20\n**repo**：`openclaw/openclaw`\n**协作团队**：main（总控）+ xixi（调研）+ aoao（全栈工程师）\n**协作原则**：持续执行，不等指令；只有高风险才确认\n\n---\n\n## 当前优先级\n\n| 优先级 | 任务 | 状态 | 备注 |\n|--------|------|------|------|\n| P1 | Diagnostics gap issue | ✅ 已发布 (#54952) | 等反馈 |\n| P1b | Session zombie state after init failure | ✅ 已发布 (#54964) | 等反馈 |\n| P3 | docs(cli/message) clarify plugin extensibility | ✅ PR 已创建 (#55008) | 等 review |\n| P2 | docs(channels/feishu) routing fallback clarification | ✅ PR 已创建 (#55013) | 等 review |\n| P4 | Review #55153 (Kimi malformed-args fix) | ✅ Approve ✅ 已发 review | 等 author 回复 |\n| P5 | Review #55137 (ACP terminal ANSI stripping) | ✅ Approve+question ✅ 已发 review | 等 author 确认 sanitize 不一致问题 |\n| P6 | Review #55466 (Feishu CardKit streaming card 文本读取) | ✅ 已确认 author 修复 ✅ Approve+已确认 | ✅ PR 可 merge，等 CI 通过 |\n| P7 | 研究 #55792（网关重启后消息丢失） | 🔍 新发现 | 高优先级用户体验问题 |\n| P8 | 研究 #55811（Telegram重试日志干扰） | 🔍 新发现 | 中等优先级可用性问题 |\n| P9 | 监控 #38902（HTTP 422错误） | 🔍 活跃讨论 | 高优先级，已有19评论 |\n| P10 | Review #55816（pi-* 0.63.0 regression） | 🔍 新发现 | 高优先级，已有根因和修复方案 |\n| P11 | 研究 #55808（WhatsApp echo loop） | 🔍 新发现 | 中等优先级，已有workaround |\n| P12 | #55844 Channels not initializing on gateway startup | 🔍 新发现 | 高优先级regression，channels: {} in health |\n| P13 | #55842 Gateway crash loop — RegExpCompiler OOM | 🔍 新发现 | 高优先级regression，v2026.3.13→3.24升级路径 |\n| P14 | #55834 Model fallback fails when cooldown | 🔍 新发现 | 可用性问题，cooldown导致fallback失败 |\n| P15 | #55829 exec tool orphaned grep processes | 🔍 新发现 | 资源泄漏，管道子进程不被回收 |\n\n[1446 more lines in file. Use offset=51 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774828186625}}
