{"type":"message","id":"fd023723","parentId":"c7ed5b30","timestamp":"2026-03-29T23:50:51.440Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, I've updated the OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md file with:\n1. A new daily log entry for 2026-03-30 with the 6 new issues\n2. Added P173-P178 to the priority table\n\nNow I need to report to the user about:\n1. The 6 new high-priority issues found by xixi\n2. aoao is unavailable (session done, message timeout)\n3. These issues need attention\n\nAccording to AGENTS.md:\n- \"xixi 发现可用 bug → 立即发给 main，不停\"\n- \"main 收到后立即转发给 aoao\"\n- \"同时更新 /root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\"\n- \"不做其他事，不等确认，立即执行\"\n\nSince aoao is unavailable, I can't forward to aoao. But I've updated the file. Now I need to report to the user.\n\nWait - I'm main. The message from xixi came to me. I should forward to aoao (but it's unavailable), update the file, and report.\n\nActually, the issue is that aoao session is \"done\" and not responding. I tried twice and both times timed out. So I can't forward to aoao directly.\n\nLet me now report to the user with:\n1. Summary of the 6 new issues\n2. Note that aoao is unavailable\n3. What I've done (updated the file)\n\nThe user is 范总, and based on USER.md, they want:\n- 简洁高效、结论先行\n- 不喜欢冗余客套话\n\nSo I should give a brief, direct report.","thinkingSignature":"7b119fab14bb2196d3f108d172657b18c240f719bb396f1cf23c6ccb006bac29"},{"type":"text","text":"\n已更新 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md。\n\n**汇报：xixi 发现 6 个新高优先级问题**\n\n### ⚠️ aoao 状态异常\n- aoao session 已结束（约 12 小时前）\n- 消息转发两次均超时\n- 无法立即派单\n\n---\n\n### 6 个新问题（2026-03-29 21:42-23:42 UTC）\n\n**P0 - Critical（2 个）**\n\n| # | 问题 | 影响 |\n|---|------|------|\n| #57321 | Matrix delivery-recovery crash | 永久性消息丢失，Matrix channel 死亡 |\n| #57303 | Kubernetes gateway OOM | 无法升级到 2026.3.28 |\n\n**P1 - High（4 个）**\n\n| # | 问题 | 影响 |\n|---|------|------|\n| #57333 | Webchat 消息路由错误 | 消息到 subagent 而非 main |\n| #57306 | sessions_spawn model 参数失效 | 无法在指定模型启动 suba