{"type":"message","id":"5d778912","parentId":"073dabf4","timestamp":"2026-03-30T00:55:06.121Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Mon 2026-03-30 08:53 GMT+8] **状态：成功**\n**任务：扫描 OpenClaw 社区新机会（2026-03-30 00:42 UTC）**\n\n**结论：发现 5 个值得 action 的新 issues**\n\n---\n\n## 关键发现\n\n### P0 - Critical 问题\n\n**#57349** - Heap exhaustion after extended uptime — OOM during filesystem scan\n- **类型**：bug\n- **严重度**：极高\n- **root cause**：Gateway 运行 ~17-20 小时后，JavaScript heap 增长到 ~4GB 并 OOM，崩溃发生在 `AfterScanDir` 文件系统扫描操作期间，webchat UI 打开时崩溃加速（~15 分钟）\n- **影响**：\n  1. Gateway 频繁崩溃（~15 分钟一次，webchat 打开时）\n  2. 中断活跃 sessions 并丢失 in-flight agent work\n  3. Webchat 用户看到重复断断线，长时间 session 不可用\n- **可修性**：M（需要排查内存泄漏源：node.list polling、Browser CDP sessions、Filesystem scans、Session context）\n- **建议**：aoao 修复（高优先级）\n- **log snippet**：`FATAL ERROR: Reached heap limit Allocation failed - JavaScript heap out of memory`\n- **stack trace**：`node::fs::AfterScanDir(uv_fs_s*)`\n\n### P1 - High 优先级问题\n\n**#57334** - Memory-core session indexer skips .jsonl.reset and .jsonl.deleted files\n- **类型**：bug + regression\n- **严重度**：高\n- **root cause**：`listSessionFilesForAgent` 函数使用 `.filter((name) => name.endsWith(\".jsonl\"))` 过滤文件，排除了 `.jsonl.reset.*` 和 `.jsonl.deleted.*` 文件\n- **影响**：\n  1. 只有 211/485 个 session 文件被索引（只有小 cron/subagent sessions）\n  2. 所有主会话会话被排除\n  3. `memory_search` 无法找到任何过去主会话的内容\n- **可修性**：S（修改文件过滤器从 `name.endsWith(\".jsonl\")` 改为 `name.includes(\".jsonl\")` 或使用 regex `/\\.jsonl(\\.|$)/`）\n- **建议**：aoao 修复\n- **相关 PR**：#57341（已修复）\n\n**#57353** - exec: SSH commands SIGKILL'd when stdout exceeds ~1.2KB burst\n- **类型**：bug\n- **严重度**：高\n- **root cause**：SSH 输出以 TCP-sized bursts 到达，当 burst 超过 ~1.2KB 时，pipe 填充比 exec runner drain 更快，session watchdog 认为进程没有产生 \"drained\" 输出并杀掉它\n- **影响**：\n  1. `scp` / `rsync` — hang 并被杀掉\n  2. `ssh host 'cat file'` — 任何文件 >1KB 都被杀掉\n  3. `ssh host 'diff ...'` — diff output >1KB 被杀掉\n  4. 实际上破坏了从 agents 进行远程服务器管理\n- **可修性**：M（exec session watchdog 应该在杀掉进程前检查 pipe 中是否有未读数据；或者增加 pipe drain 频率）\n- **建议**：aoao 修复\n- **workaround**：用 micro-sleeps rate-limit SSH output\n\n### P2 - Medium 优先级问题\n\n**#57348** - VS Code ACP prompts hang with OpenClaw on Windows after sendPrompt\n- **类型**：bug\n- **严重度**：中高\n- **root cause**：WebSocket 连接失败，HTTP fallback 后仍然挂起，`Gateway disconnected: 1006` 和 `connect ECONNREFUSED 127.0.0.1:18789`\n- **影响**：OpenClaw 无法作为 VS Code ACP chat agent 可靠使用\n- **可修性**：M（需要排查 WebSocket 连接和 ACP session 初始化逻辑）\n- **建议**：aoao 修复\n- **影响范围**：Windows 11 上使用 OpenClaw 作为 VS Code ACP agent 的用户\n- **相关**：#55523（相似问题）\n\n**#57339** - Telegram: plugin approval buttons don't work\n- **类型**：bug\n- **严重度**：中\n- **root cause**：\n  1. `TelegramExecApprovalHandler.handleGatewayEvent()` 只处理 `exec.approval.requested/resolved`，忽略 `plugin.approval.requested/resolved`\n  2. Grammy runner sequentializer 将 callback_query 排队在等待 approval 的 agent message 后面，死锁\n- **影响**：Plugin approval buttons 显示 \"loading\" 然后什么都没发生，Agent 挂起直到 approval timeout（300s 默认）\n- **可修性**：M（Issue 1: 添加 plugin.approval.* 事件处理；Issue 2: 添加 pre-sequentializer middleware 拦截 approval callback_query）\n- **建议**：aoao 修复\n- **相关 PR**：#57340（已修复）\n\n---\n\n**已更新文件**：/root/.openclaw/workspaces/workspace-xixi/memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md"}],"timestamp":1774832106057,"provenance":{"kind":"inter_session","sourceSessionKey":"agent:xixi:cron:6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64","sourceTool":"sessions_send"}}}
{"type":"message","id":"9e377ff7","parentId":"5d778912","timestamp":"2026-03-30T00:55:25.650Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"xixi has found 5 new issues. According to AGENTS.md rules, I should forward these to aoao. But aoao is still unavailable (session done, messages timed out). \n\nWait, this is a new message from xixi cron scan. The previous xixi message (at 07:46) had 6 issues. Now xixi has found 5 more issues (at 00:42 UTC which is 08:42 Beijing).\n\nLet me note the key differences:\n- Previous xixi message (07:46): 6 issues (2 P0, 4 P1)\n- New xixi message (08:42 Beijing / 00:42 UTC): 5 issues (1 P0, 2 P1, 2 P2)\n\nThe timestamps seem off - \"2026-03-30 00:42 UTC\" would be 08:42 Beijing, but the message header says \"Mon 2026-03-30 08:53 GMT+8\". So 00:42 UTC = 08:42 Beijing.\n\nThese are NEW issues from a fresh scan. I need to:\n1. Forward to aoao (again - since it's unavailable)\n2. Update OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\n3. Report to user\n\nBut aoao is still unavailable. Let me try to forward again.\n\nActually, let me think about this more carefully. The previous xixi message was from 07:46 Beijing time (23:46 UTC on March 29). This new message is from 08:53 Beijing time (00:42 UTC on March 30). These are separate scans - the second one happened after the first.\n\nThe issues in this new scan are:\n- P0 #57349 - Heap exhaustion OOM during filesystem scan\n- P1 #57334 - Memory-core session indexer skips files\n\n\n- P1 #57353 - SSH commands SIGKILL'd when stdout exceeds ~1.2KB\n- P2 #57348 - VS Code ACP prompts hang\n- P2 #57339 - Telegram plugin approval buttons don't work\n\nThese are distinct from the previous 6 issues. I should update OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md with these new findings and attempt to forward to aoao, noting the previous attempt failed. I also need to track the aoao status issue in the project file since it's blocking our ability to process these issues.\n\nThe cron task description indicates xixi already updated the project file, but there's a discrepancy - xixi's workspace path differs from the main workspace where OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md is actually located. Since I previously updated the correct file, I should verify whether xixi's update was actually applied or if it failed due to the path issue. I'll make sure the new issues get added to the proper file and attempt to contact aoao once more.","thinkingSignature":"3c36bd27d1c5a83fd93d3030439bb8905d2d36b312502e10ec60d3e92da2003d"},{"type":"text","text":"收到 xixi 的第二轮扫描结果，5 个新问题。立即更新 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 并尝试转发给 aoao：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_eagib624orw3_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"import time; ts = int(time.time()); print(f'Current timestamp: {ts}')\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":80,"output":665,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":102729,"totalTokens":103474,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774832106121,"responseId":"0618fcea444444126787d19b30054e23"}}
