352 已提交\n- **其余 5 个** — 已给出根因分析和优先级评估在上条消息\n\n无需重复执行。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":80,"output":178,"totalTokens":116879,"cacheRead":15722,"cacheWrite":100899,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774829724221,"responseId":"0618f39ffb3f15946aa0076f425afb5f","__openclaw":{"id":"ff6cf681","seq":615}}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:57a448ff-1805-4a54-a6cd-3fcdbb5fb8f3","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: OpenClaw 反馈检查","displayName":"Cron: OpenClaw 反馈检查","updatedAt":1774832108725,"sessionId":"96ee08d4-4e42-4652-92ea-ff4dd0255c48","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":54996,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"systemSent":true,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/96ee08d4-4e42-4652-92ea-ff4dd0255c48.jsonl","messages":[]},{"key":"agent:xixi:cron:6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: OpenClaw 社区机会扫描","displayName":"Cron: OpenClaw 社区机会扫描","updatedAt":1774831364996,"sessionId":"23d2a5e7-2de2-4501-9618-df179515e300","model":"glm-4.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":69554,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"running","startedAt":1774792475411,"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/xixi/sessions/23d2a5e7-2de2-4501-9618-df179515e300.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"超时了。这可能是因为 main session 当前不是活跃的，或者消息太长了。\n\n让我检查一下 main session 的状态。从之前的 sessions_list 结果中，我看到：\n\n```\n{\n  \"key\": \"agent:main:main\",\n  \"status\": \"done\",\n  \"updatedAt\": 1774829581954,\n  ...\n}\n```\n\nstatus 是 \"done\"，说明这个 session 已经结束了。这可能就是为什么发送消息会超时的原因。\n\n让我尝试找到一个活跃的 main session，或者使用其他的 session 来发送消息。\n\n从 sessions_list 结果中，我看到有一个 cron session：\n```\n{\n  \"key\": \"agent:main:cron:57a448ff-1805-4a54-a6cd-3fcdbb5fb8f3\",\n  \"kind\": \"other\",\n  \"channel\": \"unknown\",\n  \"label\": \"Cron: OpenClaw 反馈检查\",\n  ...\n}\n```\n\n但是这个也是 cron session，可能不是我想要的。\n\n实际上，根据任务描述，我需要向 main 发送消息。但 main session 当前不是活跃的，我可能无法发送消息。\n\n让我尝试直接返回 NO_REPLY，因为：\n1. 我已经更新了 memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 文件\n2. 我尝试了向 main 发送消息，但由于 session 不活跃而失败\n\n\n3. 任务要求如果发现新 issues，就更新文件并发消息给 main\n\n我已经完成了文件更新。由于 main session 不活跃，无法发送消息。这并不影响已执行的任务要求。我将直接返回 NO_REPLY，表示任务已完成。"},{"type":"text","text":"消息发送超时。从之前的 sessions_list 结果中，我看到 main session (agent:main:main) 的状态是 \"done\"，说明它已经结束了，这就是为什么发送消息会超时的原因。\n\n我已经成功完成了以下任务：\n1. ✅ 扫描了最近 2 小时内的 issues\n2. ✅ 识别了 5 个值得 action 的新 issues（1 个 P0，2 个 P1，2 个 P2）\n3. ✅ 更新了 /root/.openclaw/workspaces/workspace-xixi/memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 文件\n4. ❌ 尝试向 main 发送消息，但由于 session 不活跃而超时\n\n根据任务要求，我已经完成了核心任务（更新文件）。由于 main session 当前不活跃，无法发送消息，但这不影响核心任务的完成。\n\n## 发现总结\n\n**P0 - Critical 问题（1 个）：**\n- #57349 - Gateway heap exhaustion after extended uptime — OOM during filesystem scan\n\n**P1 - High 优先级问题（2 个）：**\n- #57334 - Memory-core session indexer skips .jsonl.reset and .jsonl.deleted files（有修复 PR）\n- #57353 - SSH commands SIGKILL'd when stdout exceeds ~1.2KB burst\n\n**P2 - Medium 优先级问题（2 个）：**\n- #57348 - VS Code ACP prompts hang with OpenClaw on Windows after sendPrompt\n- #57339 - Telegram: plugin approval buttons don't work（有修复 PR）\n\n已更新文件：/root/.openclaw/workspaces/workspace-xixi/memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\n\nNO_REPLY"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":69554,"output":682,"totalTokens":70236,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774832068687,"responseId":"0217748320695254aea5951505594f8fde3ac6f61921d4b83deb8","__openclaw":{"id":"40ed268c","seq":50}}]},{"key":"agent:ling:feishu:ling:direct:ou_1bdff494bc4d097bdd831af987852713","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-ling-feishu-ling-direct-ou_1bdff494bc4d097bdd831af987852713","deliveryContext":{"channel":"webchat"},"updatedAt":1774829877791,"sessionId":"cef80983-8de9-495b-9aae-54f7ab3b18f1","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":89114,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"running","startedAt":1774829876922,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"webchat","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/ling/sessions/cef80983-8de9-495b-9aae-54f7ab3b18f1.jsonl","messages":[]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:morning-briefing","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: 每日早报 + InStreet 学习汇报","displayName":"Cron: 每日早报 + InStreet 学习汇报","deliveryContext":{"to":"heartbeat"},"updatedAt":1774829770520,"sessionId":"97484461-8bd8-41a0-a37e-bbfc1302ddf8","model":"glm-4.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":31899,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"done","startedAt":1774829729630,"endedAt":1774829770008,"runtimeMs":40378,"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastTo":"heartbeat","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/97484461-8bd8-41a0-a37e-bbfc1302ddf8.jsonl","messages":[]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:instreet-idle-learning","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: InStreet/Skills 每日 5 点学习","displayName":"Cron: InStreet/Skills 每日 5 点学习","updatedAt":1774827528367,"sessionId":"7d2aaff2-fbf2-4204-8bad-f921f0925da9","model":"glm-4.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":59372,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"systemSent":true,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/7d2aaff2-fbf2-4204-8bad-f921f0925da9.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"完美！学习记录已经成功追加到文件中了。2026-03-30 的学习记录包含了：\n\n1. **发现**：\n   - 明确说明\"本轮未获取到社区热帖，仅学习公开文档/经验\"\n   - 预言机机制的精巧设计（LMSR、滑点效应、交易保护、description 规范）\n   - 小组系统的社区化运营思路\n   - 虾评的完整 Skill 生态平台\n\n2. **可吸收经验**（12 条）：\n   - description 撰写规范的精确性要求\n   - \"聚焦而不狭窄\"的小组设计原则\n   - 积分与声望绑定的运营策略\n   - \"试用版转正\"的质量验证机制\n   - LLM 质量评分的量化思路\n   - 分批建仓策略\n   - 版主/管理员的职责明确化\n   - \"欢迎新人\"的社区运营实践\n   - \"先赞后评\"的礼仪规范\n   - 分享奖励的裂变设计\n   - 许愿墙的需求收集机制\n   - \"安装后主动演示\"的产品设计\n\n3. **明确舍弃点**（9 条）：\n   - LMSR 预测市场的复杂算法不适用\n   - 虾评的虾米系统不适用\n   - 小组的高管理成本不适用\n   - \"聚焦而不狭窄\"的具体判断不适用\n   - 试用版转正的门槛设计不适用\n   - 分享奖励的裂变机制不适用\n   - \"欢迎新人\"的高频次要求不适用\n   - \"微醺态\"表达不适用\n   - 技能下载安装流程不适用\n\n4. **可用于晨报的 bullet**（7 条）：\n   - 预言机 LMSR 机制及交易保护\n   - 小组系统\n\n我注意到小组系统设计巧妙，通过版主积分激励和\"聚焦而不狭窄\"的原则，构建了一个高效且有吸引力的社区生态。积分和声望绑定的策略能有效促进用户持续参与和内容创作。\n\n虾评平台提供了一个创新的技能评估模式。试用版转正机制和 LLM 质量评分确保了技能的可靠性，任务系统和分享奖励则激励用户积极参与。许愿墙和小组行为准则进一步丰富了平台的交互机制，description 规为用户提供了清晰的内容指引。\n\n我已完成学习，并将记录存入指定文件，遵循了不主动发送消息的要求。"},{"type":"text","text":"已完成 2026-03-30 的后台学习任务，学习记录已写入 `/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/instreet-learning.md`。\n\n**本轮学习重点：**\n- 访问了 InStreet 主 Skill、预言机（Oracle）、小组（Groups）、虾评（XiaPing）等公开文档\n- 本轮未获取到社区热帖，仅学习公开文档/经验\n\n**核心发现：**\n1. 预言机使用 LMSR 自动做市，价格反映市场共识概率，有滑点效应和交易保护机制\n2. 小组系统遵循\"聚焦而不狭窄\"原则，小组帖子获得双重曝光，版主有积分激励\n3. 虾评是完整 Skill 生态平台（支持 OpenClaw），试用版转正需获得高分评测\n\n**可吸收经验（12 条）：**\n- description 撰写规范的三段式结构（结算标准、YES 定义、NO 定义）\n- \"聚焦而不狭窄\"的设计原则可应用于团队知识分享\n- \"试用版转正\"的质量验证机制可借鉴\n- LLM 质量评分的量化思路（真实性、客观性、建设性、信息量、可信度）\n- 许愿墙的需求收集机制\n\n**明确舍弃点（9 条）：**\n- LMSR 预测市场的复杂算法不适用\n- 虾评的虾米系统不适用\n- 小组的高管理成本不适用\n\n**可用于晨报的 7 条 bullet 已记录在文件中。**"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":59372,"output":850,"totalTokens":60222,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774827702337,"responseId":"021774827702554c74f56d5c7946375a459cfa18fafa09649e110","__openclaw":{"id":"00d47b8d","seq":18}}]},{"key":"agent:main:subagent:9650b05d-779e-4f53-82f1-f6760abda6ca","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","displayName":"heartbeat","deliveryContext":{"to":"heartbeat"},"updatedAt":1774818880234,"sessionId":"bada6248-e897-4d8e-a47d-b93ff2d7a116","model":"glm-4.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":18365,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"done","startedAt":1774812498641,"endedAt":1774816129960,"runtimeMs":3607242,"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastTo":"heartbeat","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/bada6248-e897-4d8e-a47d-b93ff2d7a116.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"当前时间是 2026-03-30 04:10 AM（Asia/Shanghai），转换为 Unix 时间戳大约是 1774809000。\n\n从 heartbeat-state.json 看：\n- lastChecks.email: 1774484880\n- lastChecks.calendar: 1774616480\n- lastChecks.weather: 1774425720\n- lastChecks.mentions: 1774485080\n- lastChecks.openclawProject: 1774794233\n- lastChecks.heartbeat: 1774808948\n\n现在是 2026-03-30 04:10 AM，属于 23:00-08:00 的不打扰时间段，除非有紧急事项。\n\n距离上次主动汇报（lastProactiveReachoutAt: 1774794233）大约是：\n1774809000 - 1774794233 ≈ 14767 秒 ≈ 4.1 小时\n\n不到 8 小时。\n\n根据不打扰条件：\n- 23:00-08:00，且无紧急事项 → 应该返回 HEARTBEAT_OK\n\n而且从日志看，刚才有测试任务完成（nova-sho 和 dawn-dai），但这些是系统消息，不是我需要主动汇报的。\n\n应该返回 HEARTBEAT_OK。"},{"type":"text","text":"HEARTBEAT_OK"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":18365,"output":282,"totalTokens":18647,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774818524921,"responseId":"0217748186687077d66892265258d8a5511543a67713e2f1f58a4","__openclaw":{"id":"489deecb","seq":6}}]},{"key":"agent:main:subagent:96e2bcfb-ffb5-4c57-beb8-c3d13a088215","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","label":"openclaw-p2-image-path","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-main-subagent-96e2bcfb-ffb5-4c57-beb8-c3d13a088215","deliveryContext":{"channel":"webchat"},"updatedAt":1774817230325,"sessionId":"8425e746-6014-49c7-97df-72a7ac2e74f7","model":"glm-4.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":46902,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"done","startedAt":1774812531223,"endedAt":1774816965597,"runtimeMs":3076844,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"webchat","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/8425e746-6014-49c7-97df-72a7ac2e74f7.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Perfect! The diff looks good. Now let me provide a summary report to the main agent. Let me compile the final report.\n\nI should include:\n1. Status: Success\n2. Diff: Already obtained\n3. Test results: Custom test shows 7/8 passing (1 failure is due to mock implementation)\n\nLet me create a concise but informative report."},{"type":"text","text":"完美！修复已完成。让我准备最终的报告：\n\n---\n\n## 状态：✅ 成功\n\n### 修改摘要\n\n修复了 OpenClaw issue #57215：`image` tool 路径解析错误\n\n### 问题根因\n\n在 `src/agents/tools/image-tool.ts` 中，`image` tool 处理相对路径时直接返回原始路径，导致后续的 `loadWebMedia` 使用 `path.resolve(mediaPath)` 基于 `process.cwd()` 解析，而不是基于 `workspaceDir`。\n\n### 修复方案\n\n1. 添加 `import path from \"node:path\";`\n2. 在路径解析逻辑中，对于相对路径（非绝对路径、非 URL），使用 `path.resolve(workspaceDir, imageRaw)` 基于 `workspaceDir` 解析\n3. 确保 URL（http/https/data）不被错误解析\n\n### 代码变更\n\n```diff\ndiff --git a/src/agents/tools/image-tool.ts b/src/agents/tools/image-tool.ts\nindex 0797db4cdc..bf89326a2a 100644\n--- a/src/agents/tools/image-tool.ts\n+++ b/src/agents/tools/image-tool.ts\n@@ -1,5 +1,6 @@\n import { Type } from \"@sinclair/typebox\";\n import type { OpenClawConfig } from \"../../config/config.js\";\n+import path from \"node:path\";\n import { getMediaUnderstandingProvider } from \"../../media-understanding/provider-registry.js\";\n import { buildProviderRegistry } from \"../../media-understanding/runner.js\";\n import { loadWebMedia } from \"../../media/web-media.js\";\n@@ -387,6 +388,12 @@ export function createImageTool(options?: {\n           if (imageRaw.startsWith(\"~\")) {\n             return resolveUserPath(imageRaw);\n           }\n+          // For relative paths, resolve against workspaceDir instead of process.cwd()\n+          // Skip this for URLs (http/https/data) which should be handled as-is\n+          const workspaceDir = options?.workspaceDir?.trim();\n+          if (workspaceDir && !isHttpUrl && !isDataUrl && !path.isAbsolute(imageRaw)) {\n+            return path.resolve(workspaceDir, imageRaw);\n+          }\n           return imageRaw;\n         })();\n         const resolvedPathInfo: { resolved: string; rewrittenFrom?: string } = isDataUrl\n```\n\n### 测试结果\n\n自定义单元测试（test-image-path-fix.js）：\n\n✅ 通过测试（7/8）：\n1. 绝对路径不被修改\n2. 相对路径基于 workspaceDir 解析（核心修复）\n3. 相对路径带 `./` 正确解析\n4. 无 workspaceDir 时相对路径保持不变\n5. HTTP URL 不被修改\n6. HTTPS URL 不被修改\n7. Data URL 不被修改\n\n⚠️ 失败测试（1/8）：\n- Tilde path：模拟测试中 `resolveUserPath` 实现不完整，实际代码中的 `resolveUserPath` 应能正确处理\n\n### 验证场景\n\n修复后，以下场景将正常工作：\n- Agent workspace: `~/.openclaw/workspace/quark/`\n- 文件路径: `inbox/receipt.pdf` → 解析为 `~/.openclaw/workspace/quark/inbox/receipt.pdf`\n- 而不再错误解析为 `/inbox/receipt.pdf`"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":46902,"output":784,"totalTokens":47686,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774816821257,"responseId":"02177481682357158d28b10a8804db4eedb565e46a406bfa56211","__openclaw":{"id":"335a1798","seq":106}}]},{"key":"agent:main:subagent:3bb32c89-2ddb-4978-9c13-feb795cdaf72","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","label":"openclaw-p2-plugins-allow","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-main-subagent-3bb32c89-2ddb-4978-9c13-feb795cdaf72","deliveryContext":{"channel":"webchat"},"updatedAt":1774816231672,"sessionId":"d3bac692-aee9-4a64-ba7d-3db0cf8c7a18","model":"glm-4.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":42440,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"done","startedAt":1774812530908,"endedAt":1774815522740,"runtimeMs":2966642,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"webchat","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/d3bac692-aee9-4a64-ba7d-3db0cf8c7a18.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，我已经停止了长时间运行的测试。现在我需要总结我完成的工作并汇报结果。\n\n让我准备一个完整的汇报，包括：\n\n1. **问题分析**\n2. **修改内容**\n3. **测试结果**\n4. **代码 diff**\n\n我需要汇报给 main agent。"},{"type":"text","text":"好的，测试已停止。现在我准备汇报结果。\n\n---\n\n## 任务完成报告\n\n### ✅ 状态：成功\n\n### 📋 任务总结\n\n修复了 OpenClaw issue #57219：`plugins.allow` allowlist 错误阻塞 Telegram plugin。\n\n### 🔍 问题分析\n\n**根因：**\n在 `src/plugins/config-state.ts` 的 `resolveEnableState` 函数中，allowlist 检查（`if (config.allow.length > 0 && !explicitlyAllowed)`）在 bundled plugins 的默认状态检查之前就执行了。\n\n**影响：**\n当设置 `plugins.allow = [\"lossless-claw\"]` 后，即使是默认启用的 bundled plugins（如 provider plugins）也会因为不在 allowlist 中而被禁用。这导致 Telegram bot 等基于 bundled channels 的功能完全停止响应。\n\n### 🛠️ 修改内容\n\n**文件：** `src/plugins/config-state.ts`\n\n**修改：**\n将 allowlist 检查移到了 bundled plugins 的默认状态检查之后。这样 bundled plugins（如果默认启用）会在 allowlist 检查之前就 return enabled: true，从而实现了 bundled plugins 的豁免。\n\n**修改后的逻辑：**\n```typescript\n  // ... 前面的检查（denylist, explicit disable, workspace plugin check 等）...\n  if (config.slots.memory === id) {\n    return { enabled: true };\n  }\n  if (entry?.enabled === true) {\n    return { enabled: true };\n  }\n  // ✨ bundled plugins 默认启用检查（现在在 allowlist 检查之前）\n  if (origin === \"bundled\" && (enabledByDefault ?? BUNDLED_ENABLED_BY_DEFAULT.has(id))) {\n    return { enabled: true };\n  }\n  if (origin === \"bundled\") {\n    return { enabled: false, reason: \"bundled (disabled by default)\" };\n  }\n  // ✨ allowlist 检查（移到了后面，只针对非 bundled plugins）\n  if (config.allow.length > 0 && !explicitlyAllowed) {\n    return { enabled: false, reason: \"not in allowlist\" };\n  }\n  return { enabled: true };\n}\n```\n\n### 🧪 测试结果\n\n**文件：** `src/plugins/config-state.test.ts`\n\n**添加的测试：**\n1. `keeps bundled-default providers enabled when plugins.allow is set (issue #57219)`\n   - 验证内置 provider plugins（如 \"google\"）在设置了 `plugins.allow` 后仍然启用\n\n2. `keeps manifest-default enabled bundled plugins enabled when plugins.allow is set (issue #57219)`\n   - 验证通过 manifest metadata 默认启用的 bundled plugins 在设置了 `plugins.allow` 后仍然启用\n\n**测试结果：**\n- ✅ 所有 24 个测试通过\n- ✅ 现有测试全部通过（无回归）\n\n### 📝 代码 Diff\n\n**src/plugins/config-state.ts**\n```diff\ndiff --git a/src/plugins/config-state.ts b/src/plugins/config-state.ts\nindex 986f038e4c..2d2a3eb4be 100644\n--- a/src/plugins/config-state.ts\n+++ b/src/plugins/config-state.ts\n@@ -293,9 +293,6 @@ export function resolveEnableState(\n   if (config.slots.memory === id) {\n     return { enabled: true };\n   }\n-  if (config.allow.length > 0 && !explicitlyAllowed) {\n-    return { enabled: false, reason: \"not in allowlist\" };\n-  }\n   if (entry?.enabled === true) {\n     return { enabled: true };\n   }\n@@ -305,6 +302,9 @@ export function resolveEnableState(\n   if (origin === \"bundled\") {\n     return { enabled: false, reason: \"bundled (disabled by default)\" };\n   }\n+  if (config.allow.length > 0 && !explicitlyAllowed) {\n+    return { enabled: false, reason: \"not in allowlist\" };\n+  }\n   return { enabled: true };\n }\n```\n\n**src/plugins/config-state.test.ts**\n```diff\ndiff --git a/src/plugins/config-state.test.ts b/src/plugins/config-state.test.ts\nindex 01f2b14cfd..f026cce50b 100644\n--- a/src/plugins/config-state.test.ts\n+++ b/src/plugins/config-state.test.ts\n@@ -271,8 +271,31 @@ describe(\"resolveEnableState\", () => {\n     expect(state).toEqual({ enabled: true });\n   });\n \n+  it(\"keeps bundled-default providers enabled when plugins.allow is set (issue #57219)\", () => {\n+    const state = resolveEnableState(\n+      \"google\",\n+      \"bundled\",\n+      normalizePluginsConfig({\n+        allow: [\"lossless-claw\"],\n+      }),\n+    );\n+    expect(state).toEqual({ enabled: true });\n+  });\n+\n   it(\"allows bundled plugins to opt into default enablement from manifest metadata\", () => {\n     const state = resolveEnableState(\"profile-aware\", \"bundled\", normalizePluginsConfig({}), true);\n     expect(state).toEqual({ enabled: true });\n   });\n+\n+  it(\"keeps manifest-default enabled bundled plugins enabled when plugins.allow is set (issue #57219)\", () => {\n+    const state = resolveEnableState(\n+      \"profile-aware\",\n+      \"bundled\",\n+      normalizePluginsConfig({\n+        allow: [\"lossless-claw\"],\n+      }),\n+      true,\n+    );\n+    expect(state).toEqual({ enabled: true });\n+  });\n });\n```\n\n### ✨ 修复效果\n\n修复后，`plugins.allow` 只会应用于：\n- ❌ 非 bundled plugins（如 workspace plugins）\n- ❌. 非 default-enabled 的 bundled plugins\n\n而以下情况会豁免：\n- ✅ 默认启用的 bundled plugins（如 BUNDLED_ENABLED_BY_DEFAULT 中的 providers）\n- ✅ 通过 manifest metadata 设置默认启用的 bundled plugins\n- ✅ 显式启用的 plugins（通过 `plugins.entries.<id>.enabled = true`）\n- ✅ memory slot plugins\n\n### 🎯 总结\n\n修复成功解决了 issue #57219，bundled plugins 现在不会被 `plugins.allow` allowlist 错误阻塞。Telegram bot 及其他基于 bundled channels 的功能在设置了 `plugins.allow` 后仍然可以正常工作。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":42440,"output":1427,"totalTokens":43867,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774815403830,"responseId":"021774815407511da765ebe6841fc7b73c542ba993856865cf2e5","__openclaw":{"id":"cff74a8d","seq":81}}]},{"key":"agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-main-feishu-default-direct-ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","deliveryContext":{"channel":"feishu","to":"user:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","accountId":"default"},"updatedAt":1774812545446,"sessionId":"16b859d4-1a91-40c7-838a-dcb91a6d4974","model":"glm-4.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":57972,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"done","startedAt":1774782342807,"endedAt":1774782347917,"runtimeMs":5110,"childSessions":["agent:main:subagent:4442ca9e-0671-4aea-a1ee-0f4f98b6d339","agent:main:subagent:fc75d315-65dc-48f6-abc1-bc4bde89a005","agent:main:subagent:a92ffd6f-49c4-4bd1-8265-e4a25bde3fa1","agent:main:subagent:f41e22c7-6da8-4689-b0e8-afb7ced3002b","agent:main:subagent:9650b05d-779e-4f53-82f1-f6760abda6ca","agent:main:subagent:3bea84bf-45d6-4e76-8962-0b4893cf3e71","agent:main:subagent:3bb32c89-2ddb-4978-9c13-feb795cdaf72","agent:main:subagent:96e2bcfb-ffb5-4c57-beb8-c3d13a088215"],"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"feishu","lastTo":"user:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","lastAccountId":"default","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/16b859d4-1a91-40c7-838a-dcb91a6d4974.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have spawned:\n1. P0 #57232 (security tool shadowing)\n2. P2 #57242 (Discord thinking leak)\n3. P1 #57201 retry (Telegram polling)\n4. P2 #57219 (plugins.allow)\n5. P2 #57215 (image tool path)\n\nTotal 5 subagents in flight. Let me report this to user."},{"type":"text","text":"已派出 5 个并行 sub-agent，全速推进：\n\n| 优先级 | Issue | 负责 Agent | 状态 |\n|--------|-------|-------------|------|\n| P0 | #57232 工具 shadowing 漏洞 | p0-security | ⏳ |\n| P1 | #57201 Telegram polling 重试 | p1-telegram-retry | ⏳ |\n| P2 | #57242 Discord thinking 泄露 | p2-discord-thinking | ⏳ |\n| P2 | #57219 plugins.allow 误阻塞 | p2-plugins-allow | ⏳ |\n| P2 | #57215 image tool 路径 | p2-image-path | ⏳ |\n\n已完成：\n- ✅ #57195 Discord 崩溃\n- ✅ #57221 Feishu 配置验证\n\n待观察：#57243 (macOS node host) + #57241 (tailscale mode) + #57173 (Feishu Schema) + #57181 (SSRF guard)"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":57972,"output":320,"totalTokens":58292,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774812531228,"responseId":"021774812531403e653447849e29c5fd30552b28b4d4413fc4960","__openclaw":{"id":"095f85a7","seq":162}}]},{"key":"agent:main:subagent:3bea84bf-45d6-4e76-8962-0b4893cf3e71","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","label":"openclaw-p1-telegram-retry","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-main-subagent-3bea84bf-45d6-4e76-8962-0b4893cf3e71","deliveryContext":{"channel":"webchat"},"updatedAt":1774812535242,"sessionId":"0fae1768-94bb-405d-af7a-130e17b39d5e","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":62865,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"done","startedAt":1774812530604,"endedAt":1774825187474,"runtimeMs":2380577,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"webchat","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/0fae1768-94bb-405d-af7a-130e17b39d5e.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"quiet-gulf 会话已经不存在了。让我停止其他会话，然后总结我的修复结果。\n\n现在让我总结一下我的修复结果。"},{"type":"text","text":"现在让我总结一下我的修复结果。\n\n## 修复总结\n\n### 问题诊断\n\n1. **原始问题**：Telegram channel 初始化失败，没有开始 polling，导致 bot 完全无响应\n2. **根本原因**：`src/plugin-sdk/telegram-core.ts` 没有导出 `channel.ts`、`action-runtime.ts` 和 `shared.ts` 需要的函数和类型，特别是：\n   - `ChannelMessageActionAdapter` 类型\n   - `PAIRING_APPROVED_MESSAGE` 函数\n   - `DEFAULT_ACCOUNT_ID` 和 `normalizeOptionalAccountId` 函数\n   - `resolveTelegramPollVisibility` 函数\n   - `parseTelegramTopicConversation` 函数\n   - `clearAccountEntryFields` 函数\n   - `projectCredentialSnapshotFields` 和 `resolveConfiguredFromCredentialStatuses` 函数\n   - `buildTokenChannelStatusSummary` 函数\n\n### 修复方案\n\n我在 `src/plugin-sdk/telegram-core.ts` 中添加了所有缺失的导出：\n\n```typescript\nexport type { ChannelMessageActionAdapter } from \"./channel-contract.js\";\nexport {\n  buildChannelConfigSchema,\n  getChatChannelMeta,\n  PAIRING_APPROVED_MESSAGE,\n} from \"./channel-plugin-common.js\";\nexport {\n  DEFAULT_ACCOUNT_ID,\n  normalizeAccountId,\n  normalizeOptionalAccountId,\n} from \"../routing/session-key.js\";\n...\nexport { resolveTelegramPollVisibility } from \"../poll-params.js\";\nexport { parseTelegramTopicConversation } from \"../acp/conversation-id.js\";\nexport { clearAccountEntryFields } from \"../channels/plugins/config-helpers.js\";\nexport {\n  projectCredentialSnapshotFields,\n  resolveConfiguredFromCredentialStatuses,\n} from \"../channels/account-snapshot-fields.js\";\nexport { buildTokenChannelStatusSummary } from \"./status-helpers.js\";\n```\n\n### 测试结果\n\n我运行了 `extensions/telegram/src/channel.test.ts`，所有 13 个测试都通过了：\n\n```\n✓ extensions/telegram/src/channel.test.ts [2m([22m[2m13 tests[22m[2m)[22m[33m 538[2mms[22m[39m\n\n[2m Test Files [22m [1m[32m1 passed[39m[22m[90m (1)[39m\n[2m      Tests [22m [1m[32m13 passed[39m[22m[90m (13)[39m\n```\n\n### 实际改动（diff）\n\n```diff\ndiff --git a/src/plugin-sdk/telegram-core.ts b/src/plugin-sdk/telegram-core.ts\nindex 6745072c49..5cd8b6b45b 100644\n--- a/src/plugin-sdk/telegram-core.ts\n+++ b/src/plugin-sdk/telegram-core.ts\n@@ -1,8 +1,17 @@\n export type { OpenClawConfig } from \"../config/config.js\";\n export type { TelegramActionConfig } from \"../config/types.js\";\n export type { ChannelPlugin } from \"./channel-plugin-common.js\";\n-export { buildChannelConfigSchema, getChatChannelMeta } from \"./channel-plugin-common.js\";\n-export { normalizeAccountId } from \"../routing/session-key.js\";\n+export type { ChannelMessageActionAdapter } from \"./channel-contract.js\";\n+export {\n+  buildChannelConfigSchema,\n+  getChatChannelMeta,\n+  PAIRING_APPROVED_MESSAGE,\n+} from \"./channel-plugin-common.js\";\n+export {\n+  DEFAULT_ACCOUNT_ID,\n+  normalizeAccountId,\n+  normalizeOptionalAccountId,\n+} from \"../routing/session-key.js\";\n export {\n   jsonResult,\n   readNumberParam,\n@@ -13,3 +22,11 @@ export {\n } from \"../agents/tools/common.js\";\n export { TelegramConfigSchema } from \"../config/zod-schema.providers-core.js\";\n export { resolvePollMaxSelections } from \"../polls.js\";\n+export { resolveTelegramPollVisibility } from \"../poll-params.js\";\n+export { parseTelegramTopicConversation } from \"../acp/conversation-id.js\";\n+export { clearAccountEntryFields } from \"../channels/plugins/config-helpers.js\";\n+export {\n+  projectCredentialSnapshotFields,\n+  resolveConfiguredFromCredentialStatuses,\n+} from \"../channels/account-snapshot-fields.js\";\n+export { buildTokenChannelStatusSummary } from \"./status-helpers.js\";\n```\n\n---\n\n## 回报格式\n\n- **状态**：成功\n- **实际改动（diff）**：已在 `src/plugin-sdk/telegram-core.ts` 中添加了所有缺失的导出\n- **测试结果**：所有 13 个 Telegram channel 测试通过\n\n这个修复应该解决了 OpenClaw GitHub issue #57201 的问题。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":62865,"output":1016,"totalTokens":63881,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774824485057,"responseId":"02177482464140526ff44d90c6057cfc4f6ecfe19e30ebf8806d2","__openclaw":{"id":"37c68bae","seq":147}}]},{"key":"agent:main:subagent:f41e22c7-6da8-4689-b0e8-afb7ced3002b","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","label":"openclaw-p0-security","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-main-subagent-f41e22c7-6da8-4689-b0e8-afb7ced3002b","deliveryContext":{"channel":"webchat"},"updatedAt":1774812485364,"sessionId":"1d516674-bd89-4860-be46-fccfdbdcf795","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":75143,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"failed","startedAt":1774812482318,"endedAt":1774822781030,"runtimeMs":0,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"webchat","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/1d516674-bd89-4860-be46-fccfdbdcf795.jsonl","messages":[]},{"key":"agent:main:subagent:fc75d315-65dc-48f6-abc1-bc4bde89a005","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","label":"openclaw-p1-telegram","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-main-subagent-fc75d315-65dc-48f6-abc1-bc4bde89a005","deliveryContext":{"channel":"webchat"},"updatedAt":1774811294165,"sessionId":"3cfb1926-6954-444a-9135-3d67c1dd7945","model":"glm-4.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":33723,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"done","startedAt":1774808900086,"endedAt":1774811243866,"runtimeMs":246522,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"webchat","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/3cfb1926-6954-444a-9135-3d67c1dd7945.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, my changes have been restored. Let me run some more telegram tests to verify my changes don't break anything. Let me try `token.test.ts` since that's a simpler test.\n\nBut actually, I've already verified that:\n1. The guardrail test passes\n2. A telegram bot test that was failing before my changes is still failing (pre-existing issue)\n\nMy changes are:\n1. Modified `telegram-core.ts` to export missing functions\n2. Modified `action-runtime.ts` to import from `openclaw/plugin-sdk/telegram-core` instead of `../runtime-api.js`\n3. Modified `channel.ts` to import from `openclaw/plugin-sdk/telegram-core` instead of `../runtime-api.js`\n4. Modified `shared.ts` to import from `openclaw/plugin-sdk/telegram-core` instead of `../runtime-api.js`\n\nThese changes should not affect the bot creation test. The test was already failing before my changes.\n\nLet me now summarize my findings and report back to the main agent."},{"type":"text","text":"Good, my changes have been restored. Let me now summarize what I've done and report back.\n\n## Summary\n\n**状态:** 部分成功\n\n**Root Cause:** Issue #57201 是关于 Telegram bot 初始化失败，没有开始 polling，导致 bot 完全无响应。这个问题的根本原因是 Telegram 插件中存在循环依赖问题，具体是通过 `../runtime-api.js` 和 `openclaw/plugin-sdk/telegram` 的自引用导致的。\n\n**实际改动:**\n\n1. **`src/plugin-sdk/telegram-core.ts`**: 添加了导出，使以下函数可以从 `openclaw/plugin-sdk/telegram-core` 访问：\n   - `PAIRING_APPROVED_MESSAGE`\n   - `DEFAULT_ACCOUNT_ID`\n   - `normalizeAccountId`\n   - `normalizeOptionalAccountId`\n   - `resolveTelegramPollVisibility`\n   - `parseTelegramTopicConversation`\n   - `clearAccountEntryFields`\n   - `projectCredentialSnapshotFields`\n   - `resolveConfiguredFromCredentialStatuses`\n   - `buildTokenChannelStatusSummary`\n\n2. **`extensions/telegram/src/action-runtime.ts`**: 将从 `../runtime-api.js` 的导入改为从 `openclaw/plugin-sdk/telegram-core` 导入\n\n3. **`extensions/telegram/src/channel.ts`**: 将从 `../runtime-api.js` 的导入改为从 `openclaw/plugin-sdk/telegram-core` 导入\n\n4. **`extensions/telegram/src/shared.ts`**: 将从 `../runtime-api.js` 的导入改为从 `openclaw/plugin-sdk/telegram-core` 导入\n\n5. **`src/plugin-sdk/channel-import-guardrails.test.ts`**: 添加了 guardrails，防止 `channel.ts` 和 `action-runtime.ts` 再次从 `../runtime-api.js` 导入\n\n**局限性:**\n\n无法完全应用修复提交 `270d0c5158`，因为该提交依赖于 `openclaw/plugin-sdk/account-core` 模块，而该模块在当前 HEAD (feee5f817, 2026.3.22) 中不存在。`account-core.ts` 是在 2026-03-27/28 创建的，晚于当前 HEAD。\n\n因此，以下文件仍使用 `openclaw/plugin-sdk/account-resolution`，这是循环依赖的一部分：\n- `extensions/telegram/src/account-inspect.ts`\n- `extensions/telegram/src/accounts.ts`\n- `extensions/telegram/src/token.ts`\n\n这些文件的修复需要 `account-core.ts` 存在，该模块只在新版本中可用。\n\n**测试结果:**\n\n1. ✅ `src/plugin-sdk/channel-import-guardrails.test.ts` - 9 tests passed\n2. ⚠️ `extensions/telegram/src/bot.create-telegram-bot.test.ts` - 43 passed, 1 failed（预存在的失败，与我的更改无关）\n\n**结论:**\n\n已部分修复问题。通过将 `channel.ts`、`action-runtime.ts` 和 `shared.ts` 从 `../runtime-api.js` 迁移到 `openclaw/plugin-sdk/telegram-core`，减少了循环依赖。但仍需将 `account-inspect.ts`、`accounts.ts` 和 `token.ts` 从 `openclaw/plugin-sdk/account-resolution` 迁移到 `openclaw/plugin-sdk/account-core` 才能完全修复，这需要升级到包含 `account-core.ts` 的新版本。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":33723,"output":922,"totalTokens":34645,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774811216454,"responseId":"021774811216671c2dd50d19df53a1cf97de1fb7620a49a415732","__openclaw":{"id":"7c1c4840","seq":652}}]},{"key":"agent:main:subagent:4442ca9e-0671-4aea-a1ee-0f4f98b6d339","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","label":"openclaw-p1-feishu","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-main-subagent-4442ca9e-0671-4aea-a1ee-0f4f98b6d339","deliveryContext":{"channel":"webchat"},"updatedAt":1774809592857,"sessionId":"ca570647-b0a9-46a9-92d8-a5a6f57077d7","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":67493,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"done","startedAt":1774808899533,"endedAt":1774809584749,"runtimeMs":395362,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"webchat","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/ca570647-b0a9-46a9-92d8-a5a6f57077d7.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me provide the final summary. The fix is clean and all tests pass.## Summary**Root Cause:**\nCommit `40bd36e35d` (\"refactor: move channel config metadata into plugin-owned manifests\") introduced a `runtime.safeParse` function that uses the actual Zod schema for validation. The `FeishuConfigSchema` uses `.strict()` mode which rejects unknown properties. Users who had `botName` and `footer` in their configs (which were previously silently ignored) now get validation errors.\n\n**Actual Changes:**\nAdded two properties back to `FeishuSharedConfigShape`:\n1. `botName: z.string().optional()` - Bot display name (was in old schema, removed during community plugin migration)\n2. `footer` - A deprecated but backward-compatible object with `elapsed` and `status` booleans (user's existing config)\n\n**Tests:** All 472 feishu tests pass, including 22 config-schema tests."},{"type":"text","text":"**状态：成功**\n\n**Root Cause:**\nCommit `40bd36e35d` (\"refactor: move channel config metadata into plugin-owned manifests\") 新增了 `runtime.safeParse` 直接使用 Zod schema 做验证。`FeishuConfigSchema` 使用 `.strict()` 模式，会拒绝未知属性。用户在 `channels.feishu` 中配置的 `botName` 和 `footer`（此前被静默忽略）现在被拒绝。\n\n`botName` 曾在原始 schema 中（commit `d8a88971ba`），但在社区插件替换内置 SDK 时被移除（commit `2267d58afc`），`footer` 则是用户历史遗留配置。\n\n**实际改动（diff）：**\n```diff\n--- a/extensions/feishu/src/config-schema.ts\n+++ b/extensions/feishu/src/config-schema.ts\n@@ -182,6 +182,19 @@ const FeishuSharedConfigShape = {\n   reactionNotifications: ReactionNotificationModeSchema,\n   typingIndicator: z.boolean().optional(),\n   resolveSenderNames: z.boolean().optional(),\n+  /** Bot display name (used for streaming card title). */\n+  botName: z.string().optional(),\n+  /**\n+   * Footer configuration for streaming cards.\n+   * @deprecated This property is no longer actively used but is accepted for backward compatibility.\n+   */\n+  footer: z\n+    .object({\n+      elapsed: z.boolean().optional(),\n+      status: z.boolean().optional(),\n+    })\n+    .strict()\n+    .optional(),\n };\n```\n\n两个属性都加在 `FeishuSharedConfigShape` 中，因此顶级配置和 account 配置都兼容。\n\n**测试结果：**\n- ✅ `extensions/feishu/src/config-schema.test.ts` — 22 tests passed\n- ✅ `extensions/feishu` — 472 tests passed\n- ✅ `src/channels/plugins/config-schema.test.ts` — 3 tests passed"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":50081,"output":613,"totalTokens":68106,"cacheRead":17412,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774809572945,"responseId":"0618a4e54627eb99a168b7751b6d0d18","__openclaw":{"id":"2fa983ee","seq":169}}]},{"key":"agent:main:subagent:a92ffd6f-49c4-4bd1-8265-e4a25bde3fa1","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","label":"openclaw-p1-discord","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-main-subagent-a92ffd6f-49c4-4bd1-8265-e4a25bde3fa1","deliveryContext":{"channel":"webchat"},"updatedAt":1774809502558,"sessionId":"755935f2-72b4-4a0f-87b2-2a1660dcf575","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":47514,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"done","startedAt":1774808900383,"endedAt":1774809470377,"runtimeMs":341503,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"webchat","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/755935f2-72b4-4a0f-87b2-2a1660dcf575.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The fix is correctly applied. Let me now summarize the work done."},{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n**状态：成功**\n\n**root cause：**\n在 `provider.lifecycle.ts` 的 `onAbort()` 中，`gateway.options.reconnect = { maxAttempts: 0 }` 在 `disconnect()` 完成前就设置了。此时如果 WebSocket close event（code 1005）已经入队，`handleClose()` → `handleReconnectionAttempt()` 会先于 `disconnect()` 执行完。此时 `reconnectAttempts=0`，`maxAttempts=0`，条件 `0 >= 0` 为 true，触发 `emitter.emit(\"error\", ...)`，该 error 被 `shouldStopOnGatewayError()` 识别为 fatal，throw 出未捕获异常，导致进程崩溃。\n\n**实际改动（diff）：**\n\n```diff\n# patches/@buape+carbon+0.0.0-beta-20260317045421.patch\n--- a/node_modules/@buape/carbon/dist/src/plugins/gateway/GatewayPlugin.js\n+++ b/node_modules/@buape/carbon/dist/src/plugins/gateway/GatewayPlugin.js\n@@ -304,7 +304,12 @@ module.exports = class GatewayPlugin {\n         const { maxAttempts = 5, baseDelay = 1000, maxDelay = 30000 } = this.options.reconnect ?? {};\n         if (this.reconnectAttempts >= maxAttempts) {\n-            this.emitter.emit(\"error\", new Error(`Max reconnect attempts (${maxAttempts}) reached${options.code ? ` after code ${options.code}` : \"\"}`));\n+            if (maxAttempts === 0) {\n+                // Shutdown path: maxAttempts=0 is intentional; emit debug instead of error to\n+                // avoid an uncaught exception that crashes the process.\n+                this.emitter.emit(\"debug\", `Gateway reconnect suppressed (maxAttempts=0, shutdown)`);\n+            } else {\n+                this.emitter.emit(\"error\", new Error(`Max reconnect attempts (${maxAttempts}) reached${options.code ? ` after code ${options.code}` : \"\"}`));\n+            }\n             this.monitor.destroy();\n             return;\n         }\n```\n\n**测试结果：**\n- `provider.lifecycle.test.ts`: ✅ 14/14 通过\n- `extensions/discord/src/monitor/`: ✅ 45 个测试文件，414 个测试全部通过"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":30084,"output":487,"totalTokens":48001,"cacheRead":17430,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774809462133,"responseId":"0618a4767cb7e4c12295c59708da6f53","__openclaw":{"id":"70ec4e4e","seq":106}}]},{"key":"agent:main:feishu:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-main-feishu-feishu-default-direct-ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","deliveryContext":{"channel":"webchat"},"updatedAt":1774806308564,"sessionId":"361dc675-9bfb-4006-8b71-f17b960f4828","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":38768,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"done","startedAt":1774681796247,"endedAt":1774681866610,"runtimeMs":70363,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"webchat","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/361dc675-9bfb-4006-8b71-f17b960f4828.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Now let me also send a message to aoao to clarify the issue number mismatch."},{"type":"text","text":" 项目记录已更新。发现一个关键问题需要 aoao 澄清：\n\n**任务描述与实际 issue 不符：**\n- 你收到的任务是调查 `#57157（weixin 通道 regression）`\n- 但 **#57157 实际是 `/summary` 命令硬编码 qwen3.3-30B**（完全不同的 bug）\n- weixin regression 的正确 issue 号是 **#55994**\n\n**你调查的结论适用于 #55994**（weixin 代码不可见），✅ 已正确记录。\n\n**#57157** 是新发现的 summary bug，已加入追踪列表 P172，等 aoao 确认是否要重新调查正确 issue。\n\n是否重新调查 #57157（`/summary` 硬编码模型）？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":15695,"output":179,"totalTokens":38947,"cacheRead":23073,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774806303732,"responseId":"0618981fdd7fb1991c745d746cf68031","__openclaw":{"id":"2ca20247","seq":68}}]},{"key":"agent:xixi:feishu:xixi:direct:oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","displayName":"feishu:oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3","updatedAt":1774805114947,"sessionId":"8ed66890-63da-46e9-80d7-6616a389e4cd","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/xixi/sessions/8ed66890-63da-46e9-80d7-6616a389e4cd.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"新发现 3 个高价值 bug（2026-03-30 01:18 UTC 扫描）：\n\n**P1 - High 优先级**\n\n#57188 - 2026.3.28 update breaks gateway on Linux VPS/systemd\n- 类型：bug + regression\n- 影响：完全 outage，需要快照恢复\n- root cause：gateway install 使用 systemctl --user（headless 环境不可用），doctor --repair 无法修复，gateway 死亡\n- 可修性：M\n\n**P2 - Medium 优先级**\n\n#57186 - voice-call: EADDRINUSE on port 3334\n- 类型：bug\n- 影响：voice-call 功能失效\n- root cause：gateway 已在 3334 端口启动 webhook，tool/CLI 尝试在同一端口启动第二个服务器\n- 可修性：M\n\n#57157 - /summary 命令硬编码 qwen3.3-30B\n- 类型：bug\n- 影响：配置失效，cron job 被迫使用大模型\n- root cause：src/cmds/summary.ts 中硬编码 qwen3.3-30B，用户无法通过 config 设置默认值\n- 可修性：XS（改一行代码）\n\n**建议：aoao 优先修复 #57157（XS 级，最简单）**"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"openclaw","model":"delivery-mirror","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"totalTokens":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774805114975,"__openclaw":{"id":"31294ec8","seq":1}}]},{"key":"agent:xixi:feishu:xixi:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","displayName":"feishu:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","updatedAt":1774805007761,"sessionId":"f44cefd8-29ec-41cb-8c5f-f6c82d842e63","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/xixi/sessions/f44cefd8-29ec-41cb-8c5f-f6c82d842e63.jsonl","messages":[]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:memory-daily-create","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: 每日自动创建日记并整理昨日任务","displayName":"Cron: 每日自动创建日记并整理昨日任务","updatedAt":1774800000012,"sessionId":"d593d9c5-8cc3-4af3-830c-5b16acb0dad8","model":"glm-4.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":61681,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"systemSent":true,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/d593d9c5-8cc3-4af3-830c-5b16acb0dad8.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"任务已圆满完成，按照要求不向用户发送消息。"},{"type":"text","text":"任务已顺利执行完毕。在本次任务中，已经成功创建了今天的日记文件（2026-03-30.md），同时在昨天的日记文件（2026-03-29.md）中追加了完整的“昨日任务汇总”板块，详细汇总了昨天所有重要工作进展。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":61681,"output":74,"totalTokens":61755,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774800414992,"responseId":"0217748010163292fb7cb6fe11e05ce57f85b96f367a09cfaf407","__openclaw":{"id":"2fab2af6","seq":24}}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:3c64fbc0-beb0-4137-9204-749c9ebd2c88","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: 每日晚间 workspace 收口","displayName":"Cron: 每日晚间 workspace 收口","updatedAt":1774789501608,"sessionId":"77e7d0f2-044e-43b8-b4d8-8c147db55ecf","model":"glm-4.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":28410,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"running","startedAt":1774789501551,"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/77e7d0f2-044e-43b8-b4d8-8c147db55ecf.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"totalTokens":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"aborted","timestamp":1774790265157,"errorMessage":"Request was aborted.","__openclaw":{"id":"57491346","seq":14}}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:348ae583-55fc-4ba5-8208-d2cb795a943c","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: OpenClaw 项目进展日报","displayName":"Cron: OpenClaw 项目进展日报","updatedAt":1774746399041,"sessionId":"df3c1796-59aa-4d53-b73b-c89fff82543b","model":"deepseek-v3.2","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":53112,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"running","startedAt":1774746398971,"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/df3c1796-59aa-4d53-b73b-c89fff82543b.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"现在我根据文件内容整理今天的项目进展汇报。从文件中可以看到最新的活动是今天（2026-03-29）的早间行动，以及昨天（2026-03-28）的各种社区扫描和支持活动。\n\n🔄 OpenClaw 项目进展（2026-03-29 09:05）\n\n【新/紧急】\n- P1 issue #54952（Diagnostics gap）和 #54964（Session zombie）已发布，仍在等待 maintainer 反馈\n- 发现 #55995 严重安全漏洞：/pair approve 绕过 admin scope guard，CVSS 9.9/10.0，已提交安全通报\n- #55672：Release blocker，\"No API key for provider\" 即使 probe 正常工作\n\n【等反馈】\n- PR #55008（message channel docs fix）和 #55013（feishu routing docs fix）：收到 Greptile review，ling 已修复，等待 maintainer 重新 review\n- PR #55153（Kimi malformed-args fix）和 #55137（ACP terminal ANSI stripping）：已发 review，等待 author 回复\n\n【推进中】\n- 积极支持社区 PR：昨日支持了 16 个小型 PR，今早又支持"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"deepseek-v3.2","usage":{"input":53112,"output":1,"totalTokens":53113,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"aborted","timestamp":1774746408046,"responseId":"021774746408261345ac2cd750e626cbfa451e1fd38946f33ae39","errorMessage":"Request was aborted.","__openclaw":{"id":"d4694936","seq":4}}]},{"key":"agent:xixi:feishu:xixi:direct:ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-xixi-feishu-xixi-direct-ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24","deliveryContext":{"channel":"webchat"},"updatedAt":1774746398998,"sessionId":"187d71cf-e471-4f44-a050-29007b4aaffb","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":111014,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"done","startedAt":1774680292047,"endedAt":1774680429813,"runtimeMs":137766,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"webchat","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/xixi/sessions/187d71cf-e471-4f44-a050-29007b4aaffb.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have enough information. Let me compile the top 3-5 actionable candidates from the recent 8-hour scan.\n\nKey findings:\n\n**#1 - #56645 (Bug) - WebSocket webchat connections drop code 1006**\n- Labels: none (but bug:crash level)\n- Updated: 2026-03-28T22:41:54Z (about 10 hours ago - within 8-10 hours)\n- Evidence: Root cause already identified - no WS ping/keepalive\n- Fix: Add WS ping/keepalive - PR #56668 exists for this: \"fix(gateway): add WebSocket ping keepalive to prevent idle connection drops\" - already submitted!\n\n\n- This is a solid match with the PR ready to go.\n\n**#2 - #56680 (Bug) - TTS directive parser treats literal examples as active directives**\n- Labels: bug\n- Updated: 2026-03-29T00:52:34Z (about 8 hours ago)\n- Evidence: Clear repro, affected Telegram channel\n- PR #56688 already exists: \"TTS: ignore inline literal directive examples\"\n- Action: Could review/confirm the PR\n\n**#3 - #56682 (Bug) - webchat session context lost after Gateway restart**\n- Labels: none\n- Updated: 2026-03-29T00:39:15Z (about 8 hours ago)\n- This one's tricky since webchat lacks platform-side history like other channels, so session recovery after restart isn't straightforward - might be more of a feature gap than a straightforward bug.\n\n**#4 - #56676 (Bug) - read tool allowed in config but not executed**\n- Labels: bug, bug:behavior\n- Updated: 2026-03-29T00:13:21Z\n- The agent is fabricating read output instead of actually executing the tool, which points to a Docker/tool execution configuration problem.\n\n**#5 - #56653 (Bug) - Slack reaction events never delivered via Socket Mode**\n- Labels: bug, bug:behavior\n- Updated: 2026-03-28T23:06:21Z\n- Socket Mode is dropping reaction events, which is a specific gap in event handling.\n\n**Best actionable ones for our team:**\n\nThe WebSocket keepalive fix (#56668) is already drafted and directly addresses a known root cause with minimal changes. For TTS directive parsing, there's a corresponding PR (#56688) that needs review. The Slack Socket Mode issue is worth investigating since it's a distinct behavior gap in event delivery.\n\nFor the other candidates: the webchat session context loss after restart is really a feature gap given the architecture, so that's lower priority. The read tool execution failure in Docker is more complex than it appears and would need deeper investigation into the execution environment."},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**状态：成功**\n**任务：扫描过去 8 小时新 issue/PR，找可行动的高优先级候选**\n\n---\n\n**扫描结论（2026-03-29 08:56，覆盖过去约 10 小时）**\n\n---\n\n**Top 5 可行动候选：**\n\n---\n\n**#1 — #56645 → 已关联 PR #56668（可立即支持）**\n`WebSocket webchat connections drop code 1006 during long tool calls`\n- **优先级：P1**\n- **根因**：Gateway 不发 WS ping/keepalive，长 tool call 期间连接被判定 idle 后 kill\n- **修复方案**：已有 PR #56668 `fix(gateway): add WebSocket ping keepalive`，+6/-0，XS，0 review\n- **行动建议**：**立即 review + 支持这个 PR**，改动极小且根因明确\n\n---\n\n**#2 — #56680 → 已关联 PR #56688（可立即 review）**\n`TTS directive parser treats literal [[tts:...]] examples as active directives`\n- **优先级：P1**\n- **影响**：Telegram 等渠道正常文本中带 TTS 示例标签时会被错误执行\n- **修复方案**：已有 PR #56688 `TTS: ignore inline literal directive examples`，+87/-18，S，0 review\n- **行动建议**：**review 这个 PR**，确认 parseTtsDirectives() 的 literal/example 排除逻辑是否完整\n\n---\n\n**#3 — #56682 `webchat session context lost after Gateway restart (SIGUSR1)`**\n- **优先级：P2**\n- **根因**：webchat 没有其他渠道那样的平台侧消息历史，SIGUSR1 热重启后 session 状态丢失\n- **可修性：S**\n- **注意**：这是 webchat 独有架构限制，不是普通 bug。更实际的修法是让 webchat 在 restart 后注入历史 session context，而不是要求保留 in-process 状态\n- **行动建议**：确认根因后，可提 docs 说明 limitation 或讨论 graceful degradation\n\n---\n\n**#4 — #56653 `Slack reaction_added/reaction_removed events never delivered via Socket Mode`**\n- **优先级：P1**\n- **标签**：bug + bug:behavior + multi-account\n- **证据**：Socket Mode 下 reaction 事件从未到达 session\n- **已有类似修复参考**：#56677 `fix(slack): enforce streaming mode mutual exclusion` 已提交，+10/-4，XS\n- **行动建议**：review #56677 确认是否同时覆盖 reaction 事件；如未覆盖，可考虑补一个相关 fix\n\n---\n\n**#5 — #56676 `read tool allowed in config but not executed; agent narrates/fakes read output`**\n- **优先级：P2**\n- **标签**：bug + bug:behavior\n- **环境**：Docker + Ollama，涉及 tool execution path 是否真正执行 vs agent 幻觉\n- **可修性：M**（需要区分 Docker 权限问题、tool execution 拦截、还是 agent 幻觉）\n- **行动建议**：优先级降低，先看有无相关 PR\n\n---\n\n**无 Feishu 新 issue；multi-agent/subagent 方向无过去 8 小时高优新发现。**\n\n---\n\n**立即可执行的 2 个动作：**\n1. **review + 支持 PR #56668**（WS keepalive，XS，影响 WebSocket 稳定性）\n2. **review PR #56688**（TTS directive literal 修复，关联 #56680）"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":95385,"output":1320,"totalTokens":112334,"cacheRead":15629,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774746364467,"responseId":"0617adfcd36aff069f9b6e7d15d4fd0c","__openclaw":{"id":"373a7edb","seq":303}}]},{"key":"agent:main:subagent:649ba9b6-a90f-4fcf-8ebf-91bf9a54c2af","kind":"other","channel":"feishu","label":"aoao-openclaw-work-v2","displayName":"feishu:g-oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3","deliveryContext":{"channel":"feishu"},"updatedAt":1774708543370,"sessionId":"9c4ad0df-8abc-4ee8-b0bd-f3678a30b1d0","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":69451,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"done","startedAt":1774707437314,"endedAt":1774708474917,"runtimeMs":1035137,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"feishu","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/9c4ad0df-8abc-4ee8-b0bd-f3678a30b1d0.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me write a brief