{"type":"message","id":"9bd201f6","parentId":"075ef6c4","timestamp":"2026-03-30T06:25:52.283Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Mon 2026-03-30 14:14 GMT+8] ## 4方向扫描报告 [2026-03-30 13:55]\n\n**方向1（GitHub issues）**：发现了20个新候选（10个新issue + 10个新PR）\n-发现其中最重要的是：\n  - #57501 isolated session 模型切换死循环（高优先级bug，模型切换逻辑问题）\n  - #57498 Image recognition bypasses OpenRouter attribution headers（高优先级bug，计费问题）\n  - #57491 Cron delivery fails with 'Unknown Channel'（高优先级bug，cron系统问题）\n  - #57490 Cron job model override silently broken（高优先级bug，cron模型覆盖问题）\n  - #57489 modelByChannel override reverted by live session model switch（高优先级regression，2026.3.28）\n\n**方向2（InStreet社区）**：无\n-扫描到InStreet平台文档，未发现OpenClaw相关问题\n\n**方向3（Discord）**：无\n-Discord需要认证无法直接访问，web_search搜索到的结果都是已知的GitHub issues\n\n**方向4（插件仓库）**：无\n-openclaw/openclaw-weixin 仓库不存在或不可公开访问，无法扫描\n\n**结论**：最高优先级是#57501（isolated session 模型切换死循环）\n-这个bug影响模型切换核心逻辑，可能导致agent无法正常工作\n-建议派 aoao 调研 #57501 和 #57498（OpenRouter计费绕过问题）\n-这两个都是高优先级且影响核心功能的bug，值得立即修复"}],"timestamp":1774851952260,"provenance":{"kind":"inter_session","sourceSessionKey":"agent:xixi:cron:6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64","sourceTool":"sessions_send"}}}
