{"type":"message","id":"613f7d62","parentId":"17be1128","timestamp":"2026-03-30T19:54:27.266Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is telling me to continue where I left off. Looking at the conversation history, I've been:\n\n1. Receiving xixi's cron scan reports with new issues\n2. Updating OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md file with all new findings\n3. Trying to forward to aoao (but it keeps timing out)\n4. Reporting to user each time\n5. User keeps asking me to continue\n\nThe problem is that aoao's session is showing as \"done\" (ended at 2026-03-30 19:02:51 Beijing time, ~15 hours ago), but sessions_send to that session keeps timing out. This suggests aoao is actually still running and processing messages, but the session status API is showing it as \"done\" for some reason.\n\nAccording to AGENTS.md:\n- \"失败 / 超时 / 无权限 / 不确定，一律直接回 main\"\n\nSo if aoao is not responding (sessions_send timing out), I should NOT keep trying to forward to aoao. Instead, I should:\n1. Update the tracking in OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md to note aoao is unavailable/timing out\n2. Report to user that aoao is unavailable and provide alternative suggestions\n\nLet me check the current heartbeat-state.json to update one last time, then provide a concise final report.\n\nI should:\n1. Update heartbeat-state.json with current timestamp\n2. Report to user that aoao is unavailable but we're tracking issues\n3. Suggest either manually restarting aoao, or that I continue monitoring through project file\n\nLet me update heartbeat-state.json first to reflect this status, then report.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_1rwlzf4ej2j6w2cdvglqt6n5","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"import time, json; as ts = int(time.time()); state = json.load(open('/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/heartbeat-state.json')); state['lastProactiveReachoutAt'] = ts; state['updatedAt'] = '2026-03-31T02:33:00.000000'; json.dump(state, open('/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/heartbeat-state.json', 'w'), indent=2); print(f'Updated heartbeat state: {ts}')\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":138492,"output":450,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":138942,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774900407733,"responseId":"021774900407912e70bd5cd8ac63a2aabaf92639e3ab2c32d76ad"}}
