{"type":"message","id":"604a4596","parentId":"4d4d5b22","timestamp":"2026-03-30T19:54:56.691Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user's message is \"Continue where you left off. The previous model attempt failed or timed out.\" This is a continuation prompt. The user wants me to continue from where I left off.\n\nLooking at the conversation history:\n1. xixi has been sending scan reports\n2. I've been updating OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md with new issues\n3. I've been trying to forward to aoao but it keeps timing out (session status: \"done\")\n4. I've been reporting to user with \"Continue where you left off\"\n\nThe issue is that aoao's session is \"done\" but somehow keeps responding to messages (as evidenced by its message content about acknowledging duplicate sends and reporting it's done). This is a confusing situation.\n\nSince aoao's session shows as \"done\" but keeps responding, and sessions_send to aoao keeps timing out, I have a few options:\n1. Try spawning a new aoao session to handle these issues\n2. Or try to check if there's a different session key that might work\n3. Or just report to user that aoao seems unavailable but we're tracking issues\n\nGiven that:\n- There are 26 high-priority issues being tracked in OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\n- aoao is not handling them effectively (session done, timing out)\n- The user wants me to continue\n\nI should:\n1. Try spawning a new aoao session with the issues\n2. If that doesn't work, provide a status update\n\nLet me try spawning a new aoao session to handle the pending issues.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"收到继续请求。aoao 会话状态为 \"done\"，消息转发持续超时。\n\n让我尝试派生新的 aoao 会话来处理待办问题："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_y3w7wkplxumwgggmjromlmh9","name":"sessions_spawn","arguments":{"runtime":"acp","agentId":"aoao","task":"立即处理这 26 个高优先级待办问题（来自 xixi 多轮扫描）：\n\n### P0 - Critical（2 个）\n- **#57551** - Kimi k2p5 provider 完全失效（\"Unexpected event order\"）\n- **#57550** - HTTP API Token auth broken（\"missing scope: operator.write\"）\n\n### P1 - High（24 个）\n- **#57540** - Isolated cron sessions fail\n- **#57538** - claude-haiku-4-5 missing\n- **#57536** - feishu tenant_access_token failure\n- **#57552** - Telegram media download blocked by SSRF guard\n- ... (其余 20 个 P1 问题)\n\n所有问题详情在 memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md（P193‑P203）。\n\n请立即分析根因并生成修复 PR，特别是 P0 级别的两个问题。","thread":true}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":139070,"output":591,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":139661,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774900467791,"responseId":"021774900468004e70bd5cd8ac63a2aabaf92639e3ab2c3422c50"}}
