{"type":"message","id":"8978f385","parentId":"a4caeda6","timestamp":"2026-03-30T19:56:42.872Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is again asking me to continue where I left off. This seems like a loop - the user keeps asking me to continue when I report that something failed or timed out.\n\nLooking at the situation:\n1. xixi has sent multiple scan reports with many new issues (P0, P1, P2)\n2. I've been updating OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md with all these new issues\n3. I've tried to forward to aoao multiple times, but it keeps timing out (session shows \"done\" but sessions_send keeps timing out)\n4. The user keeps asking me to \"continue where you left off\"\n\nThis appears to be a communication breakdown issue. The user is not seeing my responses or is not satisfied with the status. Let me provide a clear, final status report without trying to continue looping.\n\nI should:\n- State clearly what has been done (updated files multiple times)\n- Acknowledge that aoao is not responding to messages (timing out)\n- Provide a concise summary of the current situation\n- Offer practical alternatives\n\nThis is NOT a HEARTBEAT_OK response - there ARE issues that need attention.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"**已完成的工作：**\n\n1. ✅ 更新 `memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md` —— xixi 的 26 个新发现（P193‑P204）已全部记录\n2. ✅ 更新 `heartbeat-state.json` —— 时间戳同步完毕\n3. ✅ 尝试转发给 aoao —— 已尝试 4 次，均超时\n\n---\n\n**当前情况：**\n\n- aoao session 状态 = \"done\"，消息转发持续超时\n- 待处理问题：26 个高优先级（P0×2 + P1×24）\n\n---\n\n**根本原因：**\n\naoao 的 session 已结束（endedAt: 2026-03-30 03:02 Beijing），但可能仍在监控消息队列。`sessions_send` 工具每次都返回 `status: \"timeout\"`，而 aoao 的实际状态是 \"done\"，导致无法新消息入队。\n\n---\n\n**建议方案（按优先级排序）：**\n\n### 立即方案：手动唤醒 aoao\n运行以下命令重启 aoao session：\n```bash\nopenclaw gateway restart --agent aoao\n```\n\n### 备选方案：持续监控\n如果无法立即唤醒，建议：\n1. 手动在飞书中 @aoao 确认状态\n2. 暂时继续由 main 派单处理这 26 个问题（可拆分成多个并行 sub‑agent）\n\n### 临时缓解措施\n在重启 aoao 之前，可先手动修复最紧急的 P0 问题：\n- **#57523 P0** - kimi 无限递归重试（edit 工具参数错误）\n  修改位置：`src/agents/tools/edit.ts`，移除错误的参数校验逻辑\n  这是 1 行代码修复，风险极低\n\n---\n\n**下一步：**\n建议优先执行\"临时缓解措施\"（修复 #57523），然后再重启 aoao 处理其余 25 个问题。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":140189,"output":652,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":140841,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774900557472,"responseId":"021774900559772941531497079c912b7846ffe9243569de511e5"}}
