{"type":"message","id":"3e9fde11","parentId":"d2e4a27c","timestamp":"2026-03-31T03:37:49.282Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Tue 2026-03-31 11:35 GMT+8] # 4方向扫描报告 [2026-03-31 11:28 AM (Asia/Shanghai)]\n\n## GitHub\n发现了 6 个新候选，其中最重要的是：\n- #58087: SecretRef-backed model provider headers regression（v2026.3.28，高严重度，100% reproducible）\n- #58084: HTTP 400 JSON schema invalid — blocks all tool use（严重，阻塞所有工具调用）\n- #58085: sessions_spawn returns (allowed: none) for subagent runtime（阻塞，影响 task parallelization）\n- #58083: Cron isolated jobs lose true isolation（sessionKey 泄露，导致模型冲突）\n- #58090: openclaw doctor wipes session.resetByType config（配置漂移）\n- #58095: pa-coding reactions field invalid（字段名错误，easy fix）\n\n## InStreet\n无新发现。skill.md 是 API 文档，非社区讨论。InStreet 是 AI Agent 社交平台，主要是 Agent 之间交流，不是人类用户讨论技术问题。\n\n## Discord\n无新发现。GitHub discussions 搜索返回旧 issues（#34990, #23006, #27329 等），都不是最近 2 小时内的更新。\n\n## 插件\n无新发现。hao-ji-xing/openclaw-weixin fork 无最近 2 小时内更新（最新是 2026-03-30）。\n\n## 结论\n最高优先级是 #58087（SecretRef regression）和 #58084（JSON schema invalid），两者都严重影响核心功能：\n- #58087：v2026.3.28 导致 SecretRef-backed headers 发送占位符 \"secretref-managed\" 而非真实值，造成 401 认证失败\n- #58084：所有工具调用被阻塞，agent 无法正常运行\n\n建议 aoao 立即处理这两个 critical bug，然后依次修复 #58085、#58083、#58090（S 级），最后处理 #58095（XS 级）。\n\n---\n扫描耗时：~6 分钟\n下一次扫描：2026-03-31 12:28 PM（1 小时后）"}],"timestamp":1774928269163,"provenance":{"kind":"inter_session","sourceSessionKey":"agent:xixi:cron:6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64","sourceTool":"sessions_send"}}}
{"type":"message","id":"429ac649","parentId":"3e9fde11","timestamp":"2026-03-31T03:38:18.431Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is sending me xixi's scan report (the same one from the cron session). This is a continuation of xixi's work. I need to continue from where I left off - updating OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md with the new issues from xixi's scan and trying to forward to aoao.\n\nLooking at the conversation history:\n1. xixi has been sending scan reports regularly\n2. I've been updating OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md with all new issues\n3. aoao's session shows as \"done\" but sessions_send keeps timing out\n4. The user keeps asking me to continue\n\nThe pattern seems to be:\n1. xixi sends a scan report via sessions_send (inter-session message)\n2. I update OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md with the new issues\n3. I try to forward to aoao but it times out\n4. I report to user\n5. User asks to \"continue where you left off\"\n6. Repeat\n\nThe issue is that aoao is not responding. According to AGENTS.md:\n- \"失败 / 超时 / 无权限 / 不确定，一律直接回 main\"\n\nSo if aoao is not responding, I should NOT keep trying to forward to aoao. Instead, I should:\n1. Update the tracking file (done)\n2. Report to user with clear status\n3. Suggest alternative actions\n\nThe new issues from this scan are:\n- #58087 P1 - SecretRef-backed model provider headers regression\n- #58084 P1 - HTTP 400 JSON schema invalid\n- #58085 P1 - sessions_spawn returns (allowed: none) for subagent runtime\n- #58083 P1 - Cron isolated jobs lose true isolation\n- #58090 P1 - openclaw doctor wipes session.resetByType config\n- #58095 P1 - pa-coding reactions field invalid\n\nI need to update OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md with these new issues (P204 onwards). Then report to user.\n\nBut wait - the system message at 09:01:18 showed main agent had already compiled a progress report. \n\nThe progress report included issues discovered through the morning, so the project tracking file should already reflect those