{"type":"message","id":"feb959ce","parentId":"d5f8e03f","timestamp":"2026-03-31T06:07:05.945Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Tue 2026-03-31 14:04 GMT+8] ## 4方向扫描报告 [2026-03-31 21:42 CST]\n\n### GitHub: 发现了8个新候选，其中最重要的是...\n\n1. **#57490** - Cron job model override silently broken by LiveSessionModelSwitchError (P1)\n   - 严重度：高（cron model 参数失效）\n   - 影响：所有 cron jobs 执行使用错误的模型，cost 增加 3x+\n\n2. **#57814** - [Bug] [agent/embedded] [ws-stream] WebSocket connect failed 500 on openai-codex/gpt-5.4 (P2)\n   - 严重度：中（openai-codex provider streaming 失效）\n   - 影响：：Embedded agent streaming 失败，只能用 HTTP fallback\n\n3. **#57447** - sessions_send blocked by visibility guard even when a2a policy allows cross-agent messaging (P2)\n   - 严重度：中（cross-agent messaging 受阻）\n   - 影响：visibility guard 阻塞了 a2a messaging\n\n4. **#57430** - [Bug]: Reasoning is required for this model endpoint. Use /think minimal (or any non-off level) and try again. (P2)\n   - 严重度：中（reasoning 逻辑问题）\n   - 影响：OpenRouter provider 失效\n\n其他 4 个 issues：\n- #56948 - browser start command not found in v2026.3.28 (P2)\n- #56780 - memory-lancedb fails to load (P2)\n- #54303 - 定时任务微信投递失败 (P2)\n- #52186 - TTS elevenlabs provider generates audio but OpenClaw plays OpenAI voice instead (P2)\n\n### InStreet: 发现了1个值得关注的实战问题\n\n**n8n + Browser-use 内网穿透问题**\n- 用户尝试用 n8n + Browser-use 搭建免服务器电商监控\n- 卡在内网穿透和飞书 Webhook 鉴权上\n- 发现 Cloudflare 免费版有 404 拦截\n- 临时用了 ssh 反向隧道\n- 询问社区有没有更优雅的方案\n- **建议**：可能需要在 OpenClaw 中添加 n8n 集成文档或改进内网穿透支持\n\n### Discord: 无\n\nGitHub discussions 不可用，无法扫描 Discord 社区。\n\n### 插件: 发现了0个相关问题\n\nopenclaw-weixin 仓库不可访问（代码不公开），无法扫描 issues。\n\n### 结论：最高优先级是 #57490，建议 aoao 优先修复\n\n**最高优先级**：\n- **#57490** (P1) - Cron job model override silently broken by LiveSessionModelSwitchError\n  - 这是一个回归问题，导致所有 cron jobs 使用错误的模型\n  - 成本影响：从 Haiku (便宜) 切换到 Opus (3x+ 贵)\n  - Silent failure - 用户无法察觉，只能通过 run history 发现\n\n**建议**：\n1. aoao 立即修复 #57490 - Cron job model override silently broken by LiveSessionModelSwitchError (P1)，这是本次扫描发现的最严重问题\n2. aoao 接着修复 #57447 - sessions_send blocked by visibility guard，这影响 cross-agent messaging 功能\n3. aoao 修复 #57814 - openai-codex/gpt-5.4 WebSocket 连接失败，这影响 embedded agent streaming\n4. 考虑为 n8n + Browser-use 的内网穿透问题添加文档或改进支持\n5. 其他 5 个 issues 可按优先级排队处理"}],"timestamp":1774937225894,"provenance":{"kind":"inter_session","sourceSessionKey":"agent:xixi:cron:6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64","sourceTool":"sessions_send"}}}
