{"type":"message","id":"8bf58428","parentId":"9adad624","timestamp":"2026-03-31T08:39:53.985Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\nLet me analyze the current state:\n\nCurrent time: 2026-03-31 16:36 (Asia/Shanghai) = 2026-03-31 08:36 UTC\nTimestamp: approximately 1774946160\n\nFrom heartbeat-state.json:\n- lastProactiveReachoutAt: 1774937236 ≈ 2026-03-31 14:14 (Beijing) = 06:14 UTC\n- lastChecks.heartbeat: 1774937670 ≈ 2026-03-31 14:17 (Beijing) = 06:17 UTC\n- lastChecks.openclawProject: 1774937236 ≈ 2026-03-31 14:14 (Beijing) = 06:14 UTC\n\nSo:\n- Time since last proactive reachout: 16:36 - 14:14 = 2 hours 22 minutes = less than 8 hours\n- Time since last heartbeat check: 16:36 - 14:17 = 2 hours 19 minutes = less than 8 hours\n\nAccording to HEARTBEAT.md active reminder conditions:\n- \"距离上次主动汇报已超过 8 小时，且确实有新信息\" - this condition is NOT met (less than 8 hours)\n\nAnd the no-remind conditions:\n- \"23:00-08:00，且无紧急事项\" - current time is 16:36, not in this range\n- \"30 分钟内刚检查过同类项目\" - last check was 2+ hours ago, so this doesn't apply\n- \"没有任何新增信息\" - we had a scan at 14:04 with new issues, but this was already reported\n- \"只是重复旧提醒\" - we're not repeating old information\n\nThe key question: \"是否有新增信息需要主动提醒？\"\n\n\n- \"距离上次主动汇报已超过 8 小时，且确实有新信息\" - 不满足（<8小时）\n- \"未来 2 小时内有日程\" - 无法检查\n- \"收到明显重要/紧急的新消息\" - 没有新消息\n- \"发现需要尽快处理的异常\" - aoao 会话异常确实存在，但已在上次汇报中提及\n\n我仔细审视 aoao 的状态。会话显示 \"done\"，消息转发持续超时，这确实是一个需要处理的异常。但考虑到时间尚未超过 8 小时，且异常状况已在之前报告中详细说明，我认为当前不需要立即重复提醒。\n\n综合判断，按照 HEARTBEAT.md 的指导原则，这次心跳检查无需额外提醒。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"**状态：无新增需主动汇报事项**\n\n- **距离上次主动汇报**：2 小时 22 分钟（<8 小时）\n- **aoao 会话状态**：仍为 \"done\"，消息转发超时（已上报，非新增异常）\n- **最新扫描结果**：14:04 已完整汇报（8 个 P2 问题）\n\n**建议**：等待 aoao 恢复后派单处理 26+ 个待办 issue。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"openrouter/free","usage":{"input":119515,"output":1207,"cacheRead":3007,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":123729,"cost":{"input":0,"output"