{"type":"message","id":"abf2a81b","parentId":"72d8d87b","timestamp":"2026-03-31T09:08:08.200Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze the heartbeat state according to HEARTBEAT.md rules:\n\n**Current time:** 2026-03-31 17:06 (Asia/Shanghai) = 2026-03-31 09:06 UTC\n\n**Last checks:**\n- heartbeat: 1774937670 → this was at ~16:36 CST (30 minutes ago)\n- openclawProject: 1774937236 → this was at ~16:28 CST\n- lastProactiveReachoutAt: 1774937236 → ~16:28 CST\n\n\n- **Proactive reminder conditions:**\n  - Future 2 hours schedule: unknown (can't check calendar)\n  - Important/urgent new messages: unknown (can't check email/mentions)\n  - >8 hours since last proactive reachout: NO - last was ~0.5-3 hours ago\n  - Exception needing quick processing: aoao is still down (reported already)\n\nI notice the timestamps don't match the current UTC time shown in the prompt. Converting those epoch values gives me dates in April 2026, but the current context indicates it's only March 31st. The timestamps appear to be inconsistent with the actual current time, so I should rely on the relative calculations instead.\n\nLooking at the recent heartbeat activity, the last check was roughly 30 minutes before the current time, so this doesn't meet the \"within 30 minutes\" exclusion clause. The real question is whether there's new information to surface—the aoao issue has been repeatedly reported already, there haven't been new xixi scans since mid-afternoon, and it's currently evening during working hours. Based on the heartbeat rules, this doesn't qualify as a situation requiring proactive messaging.\n\nChecking the \"don't disturb\" conditions: we're not in the quiet hours (23:00-08:00), but the \"30 minutes\" rule is borderline since the last check was about 30 minutes ago—likely 29-30 minutes based on the exact timestamps. The \"no new information\" condition definitely applies here since nothing has materially changed since the last heartbeat. Given that one of these conditions is met, this falls under the \"don't disturb\" scenario.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"**状态：无新增信息**\n\n- 距离上次主动汇报：约 3 小时（<8 小时阈值）\n- 距上次同类检查：约 30 分钟（临界值）\n- 无新增 xixi 扫描报告\n- aoao 不可达问题已上报，无新变动\n\n**结论：** 无需要立即通知用户的新信息。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"openrouter/free","usage":{"input":137551,"output":1112,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":138663,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774948024363,"responseId":"gen-1774948024-I2DC5ZvfmMQMqAgPn6Vq"}}
