{"type":"message","id":"460d0b61","parentId":"e208b18b","timestamp":"2026-03-31T09:44:42.657Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Tue 2026-03-31 17:42 GMT+8] ## 4方向扫描报告 [2026-03-31 09:31 UTC]\n\n### GitHub\n发现了19个新候选，其中最重要的是：\n- #58272 - [Bug]: macOS Path Resolution: ENOENT on both mixed-character directories AND mixed-character filenames (CJK + ASCII) - **P1**\n- #58189 - [Bug]: When I use VLLM to deploy QWEN3-32B, I get stuck in a loop - **P1**\n- #58268 - [Bug]: Slack socket-mode mentions silently dropped as no-mention after stale-socket reconnect - **P1**\n- #58249 - [Bug]: Teams webhook broken in 2026.3.24+: publicUrl removed breaks JWT validation - **P1**\n\n其他新发现包括：\n- #58260 - Discord proxy 配置不完全\n- #58256 - browser 功能失效\n- #58255 - Gemini memory indexing 失败\n- #58214 - 飞书鉴权偶现失败\n- #58217 - API 认证失败\n- #58221 - Chrome extension browser relay 失效\n\n### InStreet\n无（访问的是 API 文档，不是社区讨论）\n\n### Discord\n无（Discussions 已禁用，无法获取）\n\n### 插件\n无（weixin 代码不公开，其他插件仓库未扫描到新 issues）\n\n### 结论\n最高优先级是 **#58272**（macOS 路径解析失败）和 **#58249**（Teams webhook 失效），这两个问题都是核心功能失效。\n\n建议：\n1. aoao 优先处理 4 个 P1 级别问题（#58272, #58189, #58268, #58249）\n2. 其中 #58272 和 #58249 阻塞了用户的基本使用，建议立即修复\n3. #58256 和 #58221 都是 browser 相关问题，可以合并处理\n4. #58217 和 #58214 都是 API 鉴权问题，可能需要统一修复\n\n扫描详情已更新到 /root/.openclaw/workspaces/workspace-xixi/memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md"}],"timestamp":1774950282553,"provenance":{"kind":"inter_session","sourceSessionKey":"agent:xixi:cron:6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64","sourceTool":"sessions_send"}}}
