g seems inconsistent.\n\nRegardless, the current local time of 03:34 falls within the quiet hours range (23:00-08:00), and there haven't been any new scans or urgent issues surface since the last check about 4 hours ago. This meets the criteria for not disturbing conditions, so I should simply acknowledge this state without additional action.","thinkingSignature":"1e9e4e6ecce3794e9359a4aa42733823851bace247c636b7562ad35273ca1fb6"},{"type":"text","text":"根据 heartbeat-state.json：\n\n- 上次主动汇报：18:28（~9 小时前）\n- 当前时间：03:34（北京），属于夜间时段\n\n**不打扰条件检查：**\n- 23:00-08:00 时段：✅ 当前 03:34 属于此条件\n- 30 分钟内刚检查：✅ 上次检查约 4 小时前\n- 无新增紧急事项：✅ 自 xixi 第26轮扫描后无新发现\n\n**结论：** 遵循 HEARTBEAT.md 规则，夜间时段无紧急新增事项，不打扰用户。\n\nNO_REPLY"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"doubao-seed-2.0-code","usage":{"input":80,"output":773,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":139753,"totalTokens":140606,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774985659299,"responseId":"061b54bb77069b648adecee4a2ad6041"}}
